WEBVTT

02:06.830 --> 02:08.160
<b>The data you see</b>

02:08.250 --> 02:12.340
<b>is our Music Business Division's proposal
based on a SWOT analysis.</b>

02:12.420 --> 02:15.460
<b>It forms the basis for our schedule
during the current period.</b>

02:15.550 --> 02:19.090
<b>Events and shows that lose money
will be outsourced, and…</b>

02:19.180 --> 02:20.220
<b>Next!</b>

02:20.300 --> 02:22.010
<b>Our Publishing Business Division</b>

02:22.100 --> 02:24.430
<b>has implemented
wide-ranging cost-cutting measures</b>

02:24.510 --> 02:26.680
<b>in conjunction with the switchover
in media format,</b>

02:26.770 --> 02:28.600
<b>but we have yet to attain our goals.</b>

02:28.690 --> 02:29.690
<b>Next!</b>

02:30.940 --> 02:31.980
<b>Uh, yes…</b>

02:32.520 --> 02:34.980
<b>I am with the Hero Business Division.</b>

02:36.320 --> 02:37.900
<b>First of all…</b>

02:39.030 --> 02:40.950
<b>-Get to the point!
-Yes, sir!</b>

02:41.030 --> 02:43.320
<b>As our report of income
and expenses indicates,</b>

02:43.410 --> 02:45.620
<b>we expect to show a profit.</b>

02:45.700 --> 02:49.040
<b>This is due, I believe,
to the popularity of HERO TV.</b>

02:49.120 --> 02:49.960
<b>Exactly…</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:56.300
<b>The only issue is that our two
Second League heroes under contract</b>

02:56.380 --> 02:59.260
<b>continue to lose money.</b>

03:01.090 --> 03:02.390
<b>Somebody help!</b>

03:02.470 --> 03:03.430
<b>Outta my way!</b>

03:06.350 --> 03:09.020
<b>You won't get away!</b>

03:11.440 --> 03:12.520
<b>Salty!</b>

03:25.660 --> 03:27.870
<b>Come on! Over here!</b>

03:28.830 --> 03:29.830
<b>Over…</b>

03:31.870 --> 03:33.830
<b>Can't you guys even stall him?</b>

03:38.460 --> 03:40.090
<b>That poison will leave you…</b>

03:40.170 --> 03:41.380
<b>Itchy.</b>

03:41.470 --> 03:42.720
<b>…helpless.</b>

03:46.680 --> 03:48.390
<b>C'mon, pull it together!</b>

03:48.470 --> 03:49.640
<b>-Mr. Tiger!
-Mr. Tiger!</b>

03:51.480 --> 03:54.270
<b>-This little game of tag is over!
-Damn it!</b>

03:54.900 --> 03:57.770
<b>All right, time for a Wild Roar!</b>

04:00.690 --> 04:01.610
<b>Uh-oh.</b>

04:02.860 --> 04:05.280
<b>-Huh?
-Eh, at least I got the job done.</b>

04:05.370 --> 04:06.200
<b>Let go of me!</b>

04:06.280 --> 04:08.870
<b>Hold still. It's over.</b>

04:20.710 --> 04:21.880
<b>Lucky me!</b>

04:27.180 --> 04:29.260
<b>What are you doing down there?
Get it together.</b>

04:29.350 --> 04:31.020
<b>What took you so long?!</b>

04:31.100 --> 04:32.520
<b>I had things to do.</b>

04:32.600 --> 04:34.770
<b>I'll make up for it, though.</b>

04:50.330 --> 04:52.120
<b>That was amazing, Mr. Barnaby!</b>

04:52.200 --> 04:54.000
<b>You beat us to it again.</b>

04:56.830 --> 04:58.210
<b>Hey, it's Kotetsu!</b>

04:58.290 --> 04:59.420
<b>Try harder, Kotetsu!</b>

04:59.500 --> 05:01.960
<b>That's Wild Tiger! Not Kotetsu!</b>

05:02.590 --> 05:04.720
<b>Why bother? Everyone already
knows your identity.</b>

05:04.800 --> 05:07.340
<b>A hero is not supposed
to reveal his identity!</b>

05:07.430 --> 05:10.100
<b>You should focus on improving
your criminal catching skills</b>

05:10.180 --> 05:12.220
<b>instead of your silly policies.</b>

05:12.310 --> 05:14.140
<b>-What?!
-Now, now.</b>

05:21.230 --> 05:23.900
<b>I saw your show the other day.</b>

05:23.990 --> 05:27.410
<b>You were great as the frail heroine.</b>

05:27.490 --> 05:28.660
<b>Thanks.</b>

05:28.740 --> 05:31.120
<b>Think our friend saw it, too?</b>

05:31.200 --> 05:32.740
<b>The old man with the beard.</b>

05:32.830 --> 05:35.080
<b>-Huh?
-You don't have to hide it.</b>

05:35.160 --> 05:37.540
<b>I miss my handsome, too.</b>

05:37.620 --> 05:39.080
<b>Don't lump me in with you!</b>

05:39.170 --> 05:40.080
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

05:40.170 --> 05:43.760
<b>Please, that's not necessary.</b>

05:43.840 --> 05:45.840
<b>But why would you do
something like this?</b>

05:45.920 --> 05:50.050
<b>You copying my pose
has become all the talk at my company.</b>

05:50.800 --> 05:52.350
<b>It was an impulse.</b>

05:52.430 --> 05:53.560
<b>I couldn't help it.</b>

05:53.640 --> 05:55.810
<b>Mr. Bison must be desperate.</b>

05:55.890 --> 05:57.270
<b>He's bemoaning that</b>

05:57.350 --> 06:00.270
<b>his lack of popularity is more evident
now that Tiger is in Second League.</b>

06:00.360 --> 06:02.650
<b>It's not easy being an adult, is it?</b>

06:04.610 --> 06:06.530
<b>Bonjour, Heroes!</b>

06:06.610 --> 06:09.410
<b>There's a bank robbery
happening on Bastet Street.</b>

06:09.490 --> 06:12.080
<b>-Give them another good show today.
<i>-Yes, ma'am!</i></b>

06:12.160 --> 06:13.740
<b>Thank you for buying us lunch, sir!</b>

06:13.830 --> 06:15.750
<b>Yeah, help yourselves!</b>

06:16.790 --> 06:17.710
<b>Hey!</b>

06:17.790 --> 06:19.870
<b>Don't pick out the pickles!</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:21.460
<b>Vinegar helps the body recover!</b>

06:21.540 --> 06:22.630
<b>Please leave me alone.</b>

06:22.710 --> 06:24.340
<b>Hey! They're already at it!</b>

06:24.420 --> 06:25.880
<b><i>That was fast!</i></b>

06:25.960 --> 06:28.340
<b><i>Our heroes have gone into the bank!</i></b>

06:28.420 --> 06:31.720
<b>-Watch and learn, you guys!
-Yes, sir!</b>

06:32.300 --> 06:35.390
<b>-You should study too, Kotetsu.
-Huh?</b>

06:35.470 --> 06:37.520
<b>Who's the one
who uses his powers without thinking</b>

06:37.600 --> 06:39.850
<b>and always lets the criminals get away?</b>

06:39.940 --> 06:43.150
<b>Hey, I don't have a choice!
My power only lasts for a minute!</b>

06:43.230 --> 06:44.980
<b>Then time the start better!</b>

06:45.070 --> 06:46.320
<b>Now, now.</b>

06:49.780 --> 06:51.700
<b>Fire!</b>

07:05.290 --> 07:07.000
<b><i>Like a streak of lightning!</i></b>

07:07.090 --> 07:10.090
<b><i>Our two heroes vying for third took down</i>
<i>the criminals at the same time!</i></b>

07:10.970 --> 07:12.300
<b>Stay down!</b>

07:12.390 --> 07:13.590
<b>All right.</b>

07:14.260 --> 07:15.260
<b>Huh?</b>

07:15.760 --> 07:18.100
<b>-Gotcha!
<i>-</i>No fair!</b>

07:18.180 --> 07:19.350
<b><i>He's done it!</i></b>

07:19.430 --> 07:22.560
<b><i>Origami Cyclone scores using</i>
<i>his shapeshifting ability!</i></b>

07:23.350 --> 07:24.310
<b>Stay away!</b>

07:24.810 --> 07:25.940
<b>In that case…</b>

07:33.160 --> 07:35.950
<b>My ice is a little cold,</b>

07:36.450 --> 07:38.790
<b>but your crime has been
completely put on hold!</b>

07:38.870 --> 07:41.500
<b><i>A perfect arrest from Blue Rose!</i></b>

07:43.880 --> 07:44.880
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

07:44.960 --> 07:47.170
<b><i>Is Rock Bison just sneaking</i>
<i>into the background now?</i></b>

07:47.250 --> 07:48.960
<b><i>Stealth Soldier, what do you make of it?</i></b>

07:49.050 --> 07:50.760
<b><i>So that's his new strategy.</i></b>

07:50.840 --> 07:54.510
<b><i>Lately, he's been on a mission</i>
<i>to find himself.</i></b>

07:55.760 --> 07:56.760
<b>That idiot.</b>

07:59.850 --> 08:01.680
<b><i>This is awful!</i></b>

08:01.770 --> 08:03.810
<b><i>The robbers have blown up the bank!</i></b>

08:03.900 --> 08:05.560
<b><i>They're trying to make a getaway.</i></b>

08:06.860 --> 08:08.320
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

08:09.650 --> 08:12.280
<b>Sky High!</b>

08:21.660 --> 08:23.960
<b><i>Just what we'd expect</i>
<i>from the King of Heroes!</i></b>

08:24.040 --> 08:26.630
<b><i>He showed them who's king!</i></b>

08:27.420 --> 08:29.630
<b>The First League really is something.</b>

08:30.170 --> 08:31.630
<b>They're on another level.</b>

08:31.710 --> 08:34.260
<b>We're really going to have
to step up our game</b>

08:34.340 --> 08:35.680
<b>over the next six months.</b>

08:35.760 --> 08:37.720
<b>It's okay to be ambitious,</b>

08:37.800 --> 08:41.350
<b>but no matter what we do,
we can't join them until next season.</b>

08:41.430 --> 08:44.020
<b>Besides, there's no guarantee
they'll promote us.</b>

08:44.100 --> 08:47.100
<b>Every day that goes by,
I'm losing my feel for real battle.</b>

08:47.190 --> 08:48.810
<b>So what?</b>

08:48.900 --> 08:51.400
<b>We can still protect the people
no matter what league we're in.</b>

08:52.990 --> 08:55.200
<b>Is the Second League
not good enough for you?</b>

08:56.860 --> 08:58.200
<b>Don't you feel restricted?</b>

08:58.950 --> 09:02.580
<b>Well, it's not like we can
get involved with every incident.</b>

09:02.660 --> 09:05.000
<b>And the pay's less
in the Second League…</b>

09:09.500 --> 09:10.670
<b>Hello?</b>

09:11.340 --> 09:12.800
<b>Are you Barnaby?</b>

09:13.380 --> 09:14.840
<b>Too many curls.</b>

09:15.970 --> 09:19.760
<b>You're more raccoon than tiger.</b>

09:21.560 --> 09:25.730
<b>Mr. Mark Schneider has offered
to save our company from bankruptcy</b>

09:25.810 --> 09:29.110
<b>by becoming the new owner.</b>

09:29.190 --> 09:30.520
<b>Is that so?</b>

09:30.610 --> 09:32.070
<b>Ever since the Maverick incident,</b>

09:32.150 --> 09:35.530
<b>I've thought of Apollon
as a business opportunity.</b>

09:35.610 --> 09:37.110
<b>I've heard a lot about you.</b>

09:37.200 --> 09:40.030
<b>As a young man,
you created Gargoyle Technica</b>

09:40.120 --> 09:42.870
<b>and built it into one of the top
IT empires in the world.</b>

09:42.950 --> 09:44.540
<b>He's done much more than that.</b>

09:44.620 --> 09:46.960
<b>He's done a marvelous job</b>

09:47.040 --> 09:49.500
<b>of resurrecting every company
he's acquired.</b>

09:49.580 --> 09:50.880
<b>Wow…</b>

09:50.960 --> 09:53.090
<b>So what does this have to with us today?</b>

09:53.170 --> 09:56.550
<b>Actually, I'm at a loss
as to what to do with you two.</b>

09:56.630 --> 09:59.760
<b>After all,
your profitability is declining.</b>

09:59.840 --> 10:02.100
<b>I thought about
the option of firing you, but…</b>

10:02.760 --> 10:04.850
<b>I'm going to apply a reverse strategy</b>

10:04.930 --> 10:06.850
<b>by promoting you to the First League!</b>

10:08.520 --> 10:09.480
<b>That's odd.</b>

10:09.560 --> 10:11.110
<b>I was expecting more of a reaction.</b>

10:11.190 --> 10:13.940
<b>It means from tomorrow on,
you're back in the First League.</b>

10:14.030 --> 10:15.360
<b>What? But…</b>

10:15.440 --> 10:20.570
<b>He's arranged for you to join
the First League from mid-season.</b>

10:22.660 --> 10:24.790
<b>Anyway, congratulations.</b>

10:24.870 --> 10:26.450
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

10:26.540 --> 10:27.960
<b>Isn't this great, Bunny?!</b>

10:28.040 --> 10:29.330
<b>What are the conditions?</b>

10:29.420 --> 10:32.040
<b>Who cares!
We get to work in the First League!</b>

10:32.130 --> 10:34.550
<b>-But…
-Don't worry about it.</b>

10:34.630 --> 10:35.880
<b>Virgil!</b>

10:35.960 --> 10:38.550
<b>-You can decide your own salary.
-What?!</b>

10:38.630 --> 10:40.800
<b>That's how highly I think of you.</b>

10:40.890 --> 10:42.260
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

10:43.010 --> 10:46.520
<b>So I hear you've been a hero
for quite some time.</b>

10:46.600 --> 10:47.430
<b>Sort of…</b>

10:47.520 --> 10:49.810
<b>Can you share some of your stories
with me after this?</b>

10:49.890 --> 10:51.310
<b>Be delighted to!</b>

10:51.400 --> 10:52.520
<b>Is it good?</b>

10:53.480 --> 10:54.570
<b>That's nice.</b>

10:57.110 --> 10:59.400
<b>What a creepy noise…</b>

11:06.830 --> 11:09.830
<b><i>"The sun is the source of all life."</i></b>

11:09.910 --> 11:13.290
<b><i>"It fulfills us and blesses us</i>
<i>with moments of freedom."</i></b>

11:13.380 --> 11:18.170
<b><i>"As long as these two phoenixes</i>
<i>dance in my eyes…"</i></b>

11:19.090 --> 11:20.680
<b><i>So what do you think of this, Dad?</i></b>

11:20.760 --> 11:22.720
<b>Nice verse.</b>

11:22.800 --> 11:24.800
<b>-It brought tears to Daddy's eyes.
-<i>Huh?</i></b>

11:24.890 --> 11:27.810
<b>-How so? It's a total mystery to me.
-<i>What?</i></b>

11:27.890 --> 11:30.480
<b>It's a poem my teacher
highly recommended,</b>

11:30.560 --> 11:32.480
<b>but I don't get the meaning at all.</b>

11:32.560 --> 11:34.360
<b><i>Yes, it's a mystery, all right.</i></b>

11:34.440 --> 11:36.900
<b>What? But you just said it made you cry.</b>

11:36.980 --> 11:38.780
<b>Were you just saying things
without thinking?</b>

11:38.860 --> 11:40.240
<b>Oh no, of course not!</b>

11:40.320 --> 11:43.110
<b>But boy, having to write a poem
about the sun</b>

11:43.200 --> 11:45.070
<b>sure sounds like a difficult assignment.</b>

11:45.160 --> 11:47.990
<b>It's not easy being
an elementary school student.</b>

11:48.080 --> 11:49.200
<b>How about you?</b>

11:49.790 --> 11:51.790
<b><i>Are you getting along with Barnaby?</i></b>

11:51.870 --> 11:53.670
<b>Yup. Everything's good here.</b>

12:01.840 --> 12:02.930
<b>Wow.</b>

12:03.010 --> 12:05.930
<b>At $30 a glass, the total comes to…</b>

12:06.010 --> 12:07.640
<b>Hey, I'm on the phone.</b>

12:07.720 --> 12:09.430
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

12:09.520 --> 12:10.810
<b>Hello? How's it going?</b>

12:10.890 --> 12:12.940
<b>It doesn't look
like we'll make it back in time.</b>

12:13.020 --> 12:16.940
<b>We have another story to do at a house
with a cat that had quintuplets.</b>

12:17.020 --> 12:20.190
<b>Ignore those heart-warming local stories.</b>

12:20.280 --> 12:22.030
<b><i>Nothing I can do about it.</i></b>

12:22.110 --> 12:24.570
<b><i>That's what happens</i>
<i>when they lay off staff.</i></b>

12:25.410 --> 12:27.200
<b>-Ms. Agnes…
-Forget it!</b>

12:28.910 --> 12:31.750
<b>We will now begin the press conference</b>

12:31.830 --> 12:34.290
<b>to announce the return of a hero duo.</b>

12:34.830 --> 12:36.960
<b>First, allow me to introduce this man,</b>

12:37.880 --> 12:40.380
<b>our new owner, Mark Schneider.</b>

12:43.670 --> 12:46.470
<b>Hello! Thank you all for coming.</b>

12:46.550 --> 12:49.180
<b>I can't believe
we get to work together again!</b>

12:49.260 --> 12:50.260
<b>Please be good to me.</b>

12:50.350 --> 12:51.770
<b>Of course!</b>

12:51.850 --> 12:53.770
<b>I want you to do your best, Kotetsu.</b>

12:53.850 --> 12:55.390
<b>Don't act like you're my superior.</b>

12:56.350 --> 12:57.940
<b>Aren't you going to say hi?</b>

12:58.020 --> 12:59.820
<b>Huh? Why should I?</b>

13:00.860 --> 13:04.280
<b>Well, we'll be watching you guys
from up in the VIP seats.</b>

13:06.030 --> 13:08.320
<b>Don't blow it. Your speech, I mean.</b>

13:08.410 --> 13:09.410
<b>Right back at you.</b>

13:09.490 --> 13:12.700
<b>Well, I think that's enough about me.</b>

13:12.790 --> 13:16.040
<b>Let's bring out our company's heroes.</b>

13:16.120 --> 13:18.880
<b>First up, we have this man.</b>

13:18.960 --> 13:22.460
<b>After both his parents were murdered
when he was just a child,</b>

13:22.550 --> 13:24.840
<b>and this tragic yet handsome man
became a hero for revenge.</b>

13:24.920 --> 13:27.970
<b>He put an end to Jake's reign of terror
which shook the entire city.</b>

13:28.050 --> 13:30.760
<b>While pursuing the mysterious
organization known as Ouroboros,</b>

13:30.850 --> 13:34.560
<b>he came across his parents' real killer
and magnificently took his revenge.</b>

13:34.640 --> 13:40.360
<b>He is the superhero, Barnaby Brooks Jr.!</b>

13:40.940 --> 13:42.400
<b>-See you in a bit.
-Okay.</b>

13:48.780 --> 13:49.780
<b>Here he comes.</b>

13:49.870 --> 13:54.540
<b>Next, allow me to introduce the hero
who will be partnering with Barnaby.</b>

13:54.620 --> 13:57.460
<b>This is a man
of irreproachable hero experience</b>

13:57.540 --> 14:00.420
<b>who has solved many, many cases.</b>

14:00.500 --> 14:02.290
<b>Is Mr. Tiger inside that balloon?!</b>

14:02.380 --> 14:03.920
<b>They really went all out!</b>

14:04.000 --> 14:07.170
<b>Come forth, the superhero!</b>

14:08.840 --> 14:13.760
<b>Golden Ryan!</b>

14:21.400 --> 14:24.780
<b>What? This is the welcoming I get?</b>

14:24.860 --> 14:25.900
<b>Watch this!</b>

14:30.610 --> 14:32.780
<b>Wham!</b>

14:35.410 --> 14:36.450
<b>As you can see,</b>

14:36.540 --> 14:40.540
<b>this is the power of the wandering
Gravity Prince, Golden Ryan!</b>

14:42.290 --> 14:46.210
<b>The world will bow at my feet!
Remember that!</b>

14:47.920 --> 14:50.760
<b>He fights crime
by amplifying the force of gravity</b>

14:50.840 --> 14:53.720
<b>and stopping motion
within a specific radius.</b>

14:53.800 --> 14:57.730
<b>I'm told he's a hero
from the Continental Area.</b>

14:57.810 --> 14:59.480
<b>Our owner scouted him.</b>

14:59.560 --> 15:01.190
<b>What about Kotetsu?</b>

15:01.270 --> 15:03.230
<b>Wasn't Tiger being brought back, too?</b>

15:03.310 --> 15:05.730
<b>That's what I thought, too.</b>

15:10.110 --> 15:12.570
<b>Kiss my boots.</b>

15:18.160 --> 15:19.370
<b>Do you understand?</b>

15:19.460 --> 15:23.670
<b>Barnaby will team with a hero
who has more promise than you do.</b>

15:23.750 --> 15:25.670
<b>But that's not what you said.</b>

15:25.750 --> 15:28.840
<b>When did I ever say
the two would be paired?</b>

15:29.470 --> 15:32.220
<b>I have no use for a man past his prime.</b>

15:33.140 --> 15:36.260
<b>Sorry, but I only had you come today</b>

15:36.350 --> 15:39.270
<b>so that Barnaby would willingly sign on.</b>

15:40.020 --> 15:41.520
<b>That was a low trick.</b>

15:41.600 --> 15:45.400
<b>I tried to make a case out of it,
but Kotetsu stopped me.</b>

15:46.440 --> 15:47.320
<b>But why?</b>

15:47.400 --> 15:52.070
<b>You can look forward to great things
from Ryan and Barnaby!</b>

15:52.740 --> 15:54.200
<b>You tricked me!</b>

15:55.490 --> 15:57.410
<b>You signed the contract, remember?</b>

15:57.490 --> 16:00.370
<b>But no one said anything
about switching partners.</b>

16:00.450 --> 16:02.370
<b>What are you griping about?</b>

16:02.460 --> 16:03.710
<b>The money's good.</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:05.080
<b>It's not a bad deal.</b>

16:05.170 --> 16:06.840
<b>You keep quiet.</b>

16:08.210 --> 16:11.590
<b>-Are you listening? We're not done yet.
-Leave it at that.</b>

16:12.340 --> 16:13.260
<b>Kotetsu!</b>

16:13.340 --> 16:14.970
<b>Is this the raccoon I heard about?</b>

16:15.550 --> 16:19.470
<b>I knew you'd look good
under the spotlight.</b>

16:25.060 --> 16:26.860
<b>Are you okay with this, Kotetsu?</b>

16:27.360 --> 16:29.020
<b>Yeah, the timing was good.</b>

16:30.110 --> 16:32.780
<b>You were stuck in the Second League
because of me.</b>

16:33.650 --> 16:36.570
<b>I don't want to hold you back
any more than I have.</b>

16:36.660 --> 16:37.910
<b>That's not true.</b>

16:38.410 --> 16:40.910
<b>You don't have to protect my feelings.</b>

16:41.000 --> 16:42.450
<b>No, I mean it.</b>

16:43.120 --> 16:45.670
<b>I know what I am.</b>

16:45.750 --> 16:47.630
<b>But you're the reason why I…</b>

16:47.710 --> 16:50.550
<b>Truthfully, the Second League
works out better for me.</b>

16:51.260 --> 16:54.630
<b>The hours are more flexible,
and I can spend time with Kaede.</b>

16:55.130 --> 16:58.300
<b>Second League suits me better.</b>

16:58.890 --> 17:00.760
<b>Do you really mean that?</b>

17:00.850 --> 17:01.930
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:02.020 --> 17:05.890
<b>Is that the extent
of your commitment to being a hero?</b>

17:07.730 --> 17:10.190
<b>Are you saying Second Leaguers
aren't heroes?</b>

17:12.030 --> 17:13.400
<b>Is it the money after all?</b>

17:14.650 --> 17:16.740
<b>The First League does pay better.</b>

17:16.820 --> 17:18.030
<b>That's…</b>

17:18.120 --> 17:19.620
<b>I won't hold it against you.</b>

17:20.330 --> 17:22.950
<b>You just see things
differently than I do.</b>

17:23.040 --> 17:24.460
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

17:24.540 --> 17:28.460
<b>Maybe it's time we go our separate ways.</b>

17:32.340 --> 17:33.510
<b>Good luck.</b>

17:46.020 --> 17:47.350
<b><i>Breaking news!</i></b>

17:47.440 --> 17:49.520
<b><i>A crack has formed</i>
<i>in the Amethyst Tower.</i></b>

17:49.610 --> 17:51.110
<b><i>The cause is still unknown.</i></b>

17:51.190 --> 17:52.860
<b><i>It could topple over at any minute!</i></b>

17:52.940 --> 17:55.530
<b><i>We are hoping for the heroes</i>
to <i>arrive as soon as possible!</i></b>

17:56.780 --> 17:57.780
<b>Drama is good!</b>

17:57.860 --> 18:01.530
<b>Those guys are lucky to have
this incident to make their debut!</b>

18:08.670 --> 18:10.080
<b>Why am I on this side?!</b>

18:10.670 --> 18:11.630
<b>It suits you well.</b>

18:15.130 --> 18:16.470
<b>Ready to go, I see.</b>

18:18.220 --> 18:19.090
<b>You're driving?</b>

18:19.680 --> 18:20.590
<b>That a problem?</b>

18:20.680 --> 18:23.060
<b>No, that's perfect.</b>

18:24.810 --> 18:25.810
<b>Comfy.</b>

18:26.560 --> 18:28.230
<b>Take her out, Junior.</b>

18:28.810 --> 18:32.650
<b>I might have misheard you,
but did you just call me "Junior"?</b>

18:36.650 --> 18:38.530
<b>Do you hear a weird sound?</b>

18:38.610 --> 18:39.450
<b>What is it?</b>

18:41.450 --> 18:42.830
<b>Oh no! Look out!</b>

18:58.170 --> 19:00.550
<b>Going in now
isn't going to earn you any points.</b>

19:00.630 --> 19:02.890
<b>That's not the issue!
There are people inside!</b>

19:04.010 --> 19:05.810
<b>Guess I have no choice, then.</b>

19:14.110 --> 19:15.730
<b>What's happening?! I can't move.</b>

19:16.780 --> 19:17.940
<b>It's him…</b>

19:19.610 --> 19:21.530
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

19:21.610 --> 19:24.990
<b><i>Golden Ryan has pinned down</i>
<i>his fellow heroes!</i></b>

19:25.080 --> 19:26.370
<b><i>The heroes won't be able to move.</i></b>

19:27.620 --> 19:28.700
<b><i>Ryan!</i></b>

19:28.790 --> 19:31.170
<b>Stopping your fellow heroes
is against the rules!</b>

19:31.250 --> 19:32.420
<b><i>You sure?</i></b>

19:33.000 --> 19:34.960
<b>The building's about to collapse.</b>

19:43.510 --> 19:44.390
<b><i>Look at that!</i></b>

19:44.470 --> 19:47.310
<b><i>Ryan is using the radio towers</i>
<i>to stop the building from collapsing!</i></b>

19:47.390 --> 19:49.520
<b>Yeah! Blocked!</b>

19:49.600 --> 19:52.100
<b>Fine, but what now?</b>

19:52.190 --> 19:55.400
<b>Think. You can still move,
can't you, Junior?</b>

20:01.530 --> 20:02.740
<b>Good! Go!</b>

20:03.530 --> 20:05.530
<b><i>Barnaby's powers have activated!</i></b>

20:06.780 --> 20:08.080
<b>Make it quick.</b>

20:08.160 --> 20:10.160
<b>It's all for nothing
if we don't work as a team.</b>

20:10.250 --> 20:11.250
<b>But…</b>

20:12.330 --> 20:13.460
<b>this is no way to do this.</b>

20:14.500 --> 20:16.750
<b>It's all good if we score points.</b>

20:30.310 --> 20:31.930
<b>They beat us to it.</b>

20:32.020 --> 20:33.480
<b>Was that even legal?</b>

20:33.560 --> 20:35.020
<b>It sure looked against the rules.</b>

20:36.310 --> 20:37.360
<b>You're safe now.</b>

20:37.440 --> 20:38.820
<b>I saw it!</b>

20:38.900 --> 20:41.820
<b>-I saw a monster trashing that building!
-Huh?</b>

20:41.900 --> 20:44.780
<b>A huge shadow suddenly!</b>

20:44.860 --> 20:45.860
<b>Please calm down.</b>

20:48.120 --> 20:49.910
<b>Great work!</b>

20:49.990 --> 20:52.910
<b>You look cool in action, Junior.</b>

20:54.370 --> 20:56.580
<b><i>For a moment, we feared the worst.</i></b>

20:56.670 --> 21:02.050
<b><i>But the day is saved thanks</i>
<i>to the newest team, Ryan and Barnaby!</i></b>

21:02.130 --> 21:03.720
<b><i>That was wonderful teamwork.</i></b>

21:03.800 --> 21:05.720
<b><i>Hard to believe</i>
<i>this was their first outing!</i></b>

21:05.800 --> 21:07.010
<b>Congrats.</b>

21:07.510 --> 21:09.100
<b>I'll do my best
in the Second League, too.</b>

21:21.610 --> 21:23.990
<b>A death match
between heroes and savage animals.</b>

21:24.070 --> 21:25.610
<b>Now that's entertainment!</b>

21:25.700 --> 21:28.370
<b>Those NEXT aren't human anyway.</b>

21:28.450 --> 21:30.620
<b>We've gotta get extreme, you know?</b>

21:32.240 --> 21:33.950
<b>Why's he looking at me like that?</b>

21:34.040 --> 21:35.210
<b>Hey!</b>

21:35.290 --> 21:39.170
<b>OBC, which operates HERO TV,
is a subsidiary of Apollon.</b>

21:39.250 --> 21:42.960
<b>In other words, we have the authority
to silence the seven major companies.</b>

21:43.050 --> 21:48.180
<b>All that's left is for you people
in the Justice Bureau to approve it.</b>

21:48.260 --> 21:50.600
<b>I understand. We will look into it.</b>

21:51.890 --> 21:53.470
<b>May I point out one thing?</b>

21:54.930 --> 21:57.770
<b>You've left out the Second League
heroes from the contract.</b>

22:00.440 --> 22:02.610
<b>Thank you for your generosity,
as always.</b>

22:02.690 --> 22:05.280
<b>The other day,
you even came by before work.</b>

22:05.360 --> 22:08.200
<b>Not at all. I do this
because I like doing it.</b>

22:09.360 --> 22:14.410
<b>"Long ago, in a time when mankind
knew nothing of true justice,</b>

22:14.490 --> 22:19.250
<b>a Goddess built a small village
on the land of Stern Bild."</b>

22:19.330 --> 22:23.460
<b>Justice Day is right around the corner.
Will you be coming to the festival?</b>

22:24.760 --> 22:26.970
<b>I wish we could, but…</b>

22:27.050 --> 22:29.890
<b>"Driven by greed, the villagers quarreled</b>

22:29.970 --> 22:32.800
<b>and looted for their own personal gain."</b>

22:33.510 --> 22:36.890
<b>"Unable to tolerate such misdeeds,
the Goddess sent down a messenger,</b>

22:36.980 --> 22:39.230
<b>a crab, to warn the people."</b>

22:40.480 --> 22:47.190
<b>"The crab spoke:
'Repent of your sins or be punished.'"</b>

22:47.690 --> 22:51.820
<b>"But its word fell upon deaf ears,</b>

22:51.910 --> 22:55.160
<b>and the poor crab was consumed."</b>

22:55.240 --> 22:59.160
<b>"Saddened, the Goddess appeared
from the heavens</b>

22:59.250 --> 23:02.000
<b>to bring judgment upon the villagers."</b>

23:02.080 --> 23:03.750
<b>"What followed was utter chaos."</b>

23:03.840 --> 23:06.800
<b>"Rays of light
sharper and stronger than steel blades</b>

23:06.880 --> 23:08.590
<b>began raining from the sky."</b>

23:08.670 --> 23:11.840
<b>"Cattle and horses
dove into the ocean in fear."</b>

23:11.930 --> 23:16.010
<b>"Countless people fell into a deep sleep,</b>

23:16.100 --> 23:18.310
<b>trapped in a maze of nightmares."</b>

23:18.390 --> 23:19.810
<b>I remember that story.</b>

23:20.310 --> 23:21.980
<b>My parents used to tell it to me.</b>

23:24.940 --> 23:26.480
<b><i>You can't do this to us!</i></b>

23:26.570 --> 23:28.530
<b>How did this happen?</b>

23:28.610 --> 23:30.860
<b>Mr. Schneider proposed it
to the Board of Directors,</b>

23:30.950 --> 23:33.370
<b>and it passed right on through,
is how I heard it.</b>

23:33.450 --> 23:37.330
<b>What do you mean, "you heard it"?!
Let me talk with him directly!</b>

23:37.410 --> 23:40.290
<b>Mr. Schneider has no intention
of meeting with you.</b>

23:40.370 --> 23:41.710
<b>Oh, c'mon!</b>

23:41.790 --> 23:43.460
<b>He left a last message for all of you.</b>

23:44.330 --> 23:45.960
<b>And that's "Bye Bye."</b>

23:52.130 --> 23:54.590
<b>Thank you for all your work,
Mr. Schneider.</b>

23:56.100 --> 23:58.970
<b>Get him there quickly, but don't rush.</b>

23:59.930 --> 24:02.520
<b>Listen. I don't need
this sort of stuff from you.</b>

24:02.600 --> 24:05.480
<b>-Huh?
-Something about you bugs me.</b>

24:06.150 --> 24:09.480
<b>I try to limit my time
with people like you.</b>

24:09.570 --> 24:11.150
<b>But…</b>

24:11.240 --> 24:14.240
<b>Nothing seems to go
the way we want, does it?</b>

24:15.530 --> 24:19.080
<b>I've been having difficulty
mastering this new technique.</b>

24:19.160 --> 24:20.000
<b>Huh?</b>

24:20.080 --> 24:23.960
<b>I thought it might be useful
to shape my lightning,</b>

24:24.040 --> 24:26.710
<b>but I can't seem to do it
no matter how many times I try.</b>

24:26.790 --> 24:29.210
<b>Sorry, what is it you're trying to say?</b>

24:29.300 --> 24:32.220
<b>I'm saying it's hard enough
to make things work out for yourself.</b>

24:32.300 --> 24:34.720
<b>It must be even harder when it involves</b>

24:34.800 --> 24:38.050
<b>having to deal with other people
and businesses, like with Mr. Tiger.</b>

24:40.180 --> 24:41.100
<b>Oh, come on!</b>

24:41.180 --> 24:44.440
<b>We can't let ourselves get depressed, too!</b>

24:44.520 --> 24:45.520
<b>Smile!</b>

24:45.600 --> 24:48.610
<b>I envy you, Fire Emblem.
You're always so positive.</b>

24:49.440 --> 24:52.280
<b>That's because I don't have
a care in the world.</b>

24:52.360 --> 24:54.280
<b>Everyday is a happy day.</b>

24:54.360 --> 24:55.610
<b>This really sucks.</b>

24:55.700 --> 24:58.200
<b>It must've been a huge shock
to Mister Wild.</b>

24:58.280 --> 25:01.870
<b>Yeah, after all that he did for HERO TV.</b>

25:02.870 --> 25:06.290
<b>Of course, the last thing he needs
is to get sympathy from others,</b>

25:06.370 --> 25:08.000
<b>especially from an unpopular guy like me.</b>

25:08.080 --> 25:09.380
<b>That's not true!</b>

25:10.050 --> 25:13.010
<b>You may not be popular,</b>

25:13.090 --> 25:16.760
<b>but the way you take the criminals head on
makes you a bonafide hero.</b>

25:17.930 --> 25:19.300
<b>You think so?</b>

25:19.390 --> 25:21.600
<b>In comparison, all I'm able to do</b>

25:21.680 --> 25:23.730
<b>is use my shapeshifting
to attack from behind.</b>

25:24.810 --> 25:29.980
<b>A cowardly hero like me
has no right to worry about Mr. Tiger.</b>

25:30.070 --> 25:31.820
<b>I accept you.</b>

25:32.650 --> 25:34.740
<b>I think you are a hero!</b>

25:34.820 --> 25:35.700
<b>Huh?</b>

25:36.570 --> 25:40.330
<b>You have a funny way
of saying things, Sky High.</b>

25:40.410 --> 25:41.490
<b>Do you do that on purpose?</b>

25:41.580 --> 25:43.700
<b>He doesn't.
That's what makes him likeable.</b>

25:43.790 --> 25:45.910
<b>I was trying to.</b>

25:46.960 --> 25:51.670
<b>I try my hardest to convey
my feelings every single day.</b>

25:51.750 --> 25:54.920
<b>But for some reason,
everyone laughs at me.</b>

25:55.010 --> 25:56.260
<b>I see…</b>

25:56.340 --> 25:58.800
<b>I'm sorry we laughed.</b>

25:58.890 --> 26:00.850
<b>It's okay, my worries aren't important…</b>

26:00.930 --> 26:04.060
<b>Not compared to Mister Wild's.</b>

26:07.350 --> 26:10.560
<b>Sorry, man,
for causing you so much trouble.</b>

26:10.650 --> 26:12.900
<b><i>It isn't the first time.</i></b>

26:14.780 --> 26:16.860
<b>-How's Kaede?
-She's already asleep.</b>

26:16.950 --> 26:20.200
<b>She must've been exhausted after making
such a scene when she heard you got fired.</b>

26:20.280 --> 26:21.700
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

26:22.330 --> 26:25.120
<b>Say, why don't you come back?</b>

26:26.580 --> 26:27.500
<b>Yeah…</b>

26:28.710 --> 26:30.040
<b><i>Take your time to decide.</i></b>

26:31.040 --> 26:33.210
<b>Thanks. I'll call again soon.</b>

26:33.800 --> 26:34.630
<b>Bye.</b>

27:15.920 --> 27:16.800
<b>Hello?</b>

27:16.880 --> 27:19.130
<b><i>Um, is this Miss Blue Rose?</i></b>

27:19.970 --> 27:22.640
<b>It's Kaede, Wild Tiger's daughter.</b>

27:22.720 --> 27:23.970
<b><i>Kaede?</i></b>

27:24.050 --> 27:28.480
<b>Yes. You once told me I could call
if something happened, so I…</b>

27:29.310 --> 27:30.640
<b>Am I bothering you?</b>

27:30.730 --> 27:32.060
<b>Not at all!</b>

27:32.150 --> 27:34.400
<b>You're staying up pretty late, aren't you?</b>

27:34.480 --> 27:35.650
<b><i>My dad…</i></b>

27:35.730 --> 27:38.230
<b>He seems really depressed.</b>

27:39.490 --> 27:40.740
<b>But…</b>

27:40.820 --> 27:42.610
<b><i>I don't know what I can do for him.</i></b>

27:50.750 --> 27:54.000
<b><i>My beauty mind</i></b>

27:54.080 --> 27:56.540
<b><i>I'm more dazzling…</i></b>

27:56.630 --> 27:58.670
<b>My dear Rose!</b>

28:04.590 --> 28:05.510
<b>Huh?</b>

28:09.680 --> 28:10.520
<b>What?!</b>

28:16.400 --> 28:18.070
<b>What about the suit?</b>

28:27.280 --> 28:28.830
<b>Yeah, whatever.</b>

28:29.330 --> 28:32.000
<b>The suit doesn't matter
as long as I wear it.</b>

28:34.920 --> 28:36.880
<b>Huh? What?!</b>

28:38.250 --> 28:39.960
<b>There's a huge accident
on the Stern Bridge!</b>

28:40.050 --> 28:41.630
<b>Go rescue the victims now!</b>

29:02.990 --> 29:03.820
<b>Huh?</b>

29:04.320 --> 29:07.070
<b>I wish you'd hurry up.</b>

29:07.160 --> 29:10.450
<b>Sorry! I'm not good with these things.</b>

29:10.540 --> 29:12.250
<b>Forget it, old man!</b>

29:12.750 --> 29:13.960
<b>Ma'am?!</b>

29:17.250 --> 29:19.960
<b><i>I'm here at the scene.</i></b>

29:20.040 --> 29:23.720
<b><i>I'm told several vehicles have</i>
<i>fallen off the bridge.</i></b>

29:25.930 --> 29:27.510
<b>Okay, everyone. Stay back.</b>

29:28.600 --> 29:31.060
<b>-Hey, what happened here?
-You can't go in there.</b>

29:31.640 --> 29:32.520
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

29:32.600 --> 29:33.890
<b>It's me…</b>

29:34.810 --> 29:36.520
<b>Wild Tiger.</b>

29:36.600 --> 29:37.810
<b>Hey, what gives?</b>

29:37.900 --> 29:39.310
<b>You're not a hero anymore.</b>

29:40.440 --> 29:42.900
<b>It's the rules.
We can't let civilians through.</b>

29:45.900 --> 29:46.860
<b>A woman?</b>

29:46.950 --> 29:49.740
<b>Yes. She jumped in front of me
out of nowhere.</b>

29:49.820 --> 29:52.830
<b>I steered to avoid her
and fell into the ocean.</b>

29:53.580 --> 29:55.410
<b>What happened to that lady?</b>

29:55.500 --> 29:59.920
<b>I thought I ran her over,
but I couldn't find her anywhere.</b>

30:00.000 --> 30:02.800
<b>That sounds like a lie!
Are you trying to cover up your mistake?</b>

30:02.880 --> 30:05.130
<b>No! I'm telling the truth!</b>

30:05.220 --> 30:06.930
<b>I heard a strange howling sound,</b>

30:07.010 --> 30:09.260
<b>and next thing I knew,
a woman was there in front of me.</b>

30:09.340 --> 30:10.680
<b>A howling sound?</b>

30:10.760 --> 30:12.970
<b>Could it be the one
we heard the other day?</b>

30:13.600 --> 30:16.430
<b>Remember?
Just before the building collapsed,</b>

30:16.520 --> 30:18.190
<b>we heard something like, "Uuu…"</b>

30:18.270 --> 30:21.650
<b>-That's it! That's the sound!
-Huh?</b>

30:21.730 --> 30:23.980
<b>Does that mean this accident</b>

30:24.070 --> 30:25.940
<b>and the one from the other day
are related?</b>

30:26.530 --> 30:27.900
<b>The Legend of the Goddess…</b>

30:27.990 --> 30:29.410
<b>What'd you say?</b>

30:29.490 --> 30:33.030
<b>I got the feeling these accidents
closely resembled the legend.</b>

30:33.120 --> 30:33.990
<b>Huh?</b>

30:34.580 --> 30:38.000
<b>The Goddess howled thunderously
and sent rays of light raining down.</b>

30:38.080 --> 30:42.000
<b>Buildings were destroyed
and livestock fell into the sea.</b>

30:42.630 --> 30:45.920
<b>Maybe someone is mimicking the legend
to cause these incidents.</b>

30:46.010 --> 30:48.300
<b>-You're reading too far into this.
-But…</b>

30:48.380 --> 30:50.760
<b>For argument's sake,
let's say that that's true.</b>

30:50.840 --> 30:52.890
<b>No Goddess has appeared.</b>

30:52.970 --> 30:54.220
<b><i>Excuse me, everybody…</i></b>

30:55.060 --> 30:57.140
<b>About that Goddess story…</b>

30:57.230 --> 30:59.600
<b>The old cat lady
we interviewed the other day</b>

30:59.690 --> 31:00.980
<b>said something similar.</b>

31:01.060 --> 31:03.060
<b>She said she heard
an eerie sound resonating.</b>

31:03.150 --> 31:06.570
<b>When the window glass shattered,
she saw the shadow of a Goddess.</b>

31:07.190 --> 31:10.490
<b>I didn't even give it
a second thought at the time, but…</b>

31:10.570 --> 31:12.200
<b>The shadow of a Goddess?</b>

31:12.280 --> 31:15.330
<b>Was the shattered glass the rays of light?</b>

31:15.410 --> 31:17.580
<b>Come to think of it,
when the building collapsed,</b>

31:17.660 --> 31:20.210
<b>a woman said she saw
the shadow of a huge monster.</b>

31:20.290 --> 31:22.580
<b>Was that the Goddess?</b>

31:22.670 --> 31:25.210
<b>Hey, how did the legend go after that?</b>

31:25.300 --> 31:26.960
<b>I think people fell into a deep sleep…</b>

31:27.050 --> 31:30.510
<b>Hey, come on! Stop this silliness.</b>

31:31.680 --> 31:32.550
<b>That sound!</b>

31:34.890 --> 31:36.890
<b>Everyone, find where it's coming from!</b>

31:45.610 --> 31:47.480
<b>It stopped all of a sudden.</b>

31:47.570 --> 31:48.820
<b>Yes, you are right.</b>

31:50.150 --> 31:53.070
<b>What do you guys think
about the Goddess story?</b>

31:53.160 --> 31:55.160
<b>I think it's too early
to draw conclusions.</b>

31:55.240 --> 31:57.740
<b>It sounds like the occult.</b>

32:00.910 --> 32:02.080
<b>Must be him!</b>

32:21.230 --> 32:22.390
<b>What nice breeze.</b>

32:22.480 --> 32:23.520
<b>Hey, be serious.</b>

32:27.860 --> 32:29.030
<b>Watch out, will you?</b>

32:32.700 --> 32:33.570
<b>This chick…</b>

32:38.410 --> 32:40.540
<b>What the hell? Are they
supposed to be quintuplets?</b>

32:40.620 --> 32:42.620
<b>No, this must be a NEXT ability.</b>

32:42.710 --> 32:44.250
<b>I was just joking.</b>

32:44.330 --> 32:45.880
<b>Man, you're so serious!</b>

32:51.970 --> 32:53.010
<b>How's it going on your end?</b>

32:53.090 --> 32:54.760
<b><i>Nothing here.</i></b>

32:54.840 --> 32:57.100
<b>No luck here either.</b>

32:57.180 --> 32:58.890
<b>We should regroup.</b>

32:58.970 --> 33:00.060
<b><i>-Okay.</i>
-<i>Right.</i></b>

33:00.140 --> 33:03.480
<b>I'm sick of getting dicked around.</b>

33:03.560 --> 33:06.310
<b>I'd rather be doing the dicking.</b>

33:08.820 --> 33:09.900
<b>What happened over there?</b>

33:15.360 --> 33:17.030
<b>What happened, old man?</b>

33:17.120 --> 33:19.280
<b>Well, well.</b>

33:19.870 --> 33:22.040
<b>How do you do?</b>

33:22.120 --> 33:23.120
<b>Huh?</b>

33:23.200 --> 33:27.790
<b>How unfortunate after we just met…</b>

33:39.100 --> 33:42.890
<b>Should you be playing with me like this?</b>

33:43.640 --> 33:46.480
<b>Your friend is in deep trouble.</b>

33:47.100 --> 33:48.230
<b>Are you okay?</b>

33:49.480 --> 33:50.860
<b>Hey! Wake up!</b>

33:56.280 --> 34:00.490
<b>I sort of like those outlandish types.</b>

34:00.580 --> 34:03.450
<b>No slip-ups on your end, I assume?</b>

34:03.540 --> 34:06.750
<b>No. I made my round of introductions.</b>

34:14.300 --> 34:16.840
<b>-Take me to 12th Street.
-Got it.</b>

34:18.090 --> 34:19.840
<b>Hey, Mr. Lloyds!</b>

34:19.930 --> 34:20.850
<b>Huh?</b>

34:22.810 --> 34:25.180
<b>Ben got me this job.</b>

34:25.270 --> 34:27.850
<b>Until the Second League gets reinstated.</b>

34:27.940 --> 34:30.440
<b>There are no plans
to resume the Second League.</b>

34:30.520 --> 34:34.610
<b>And the seven major companies
are not interested in hiring you either.</b>

34:35.440 --> 34:40.030
<b>Well, there are other shows
like HERO TV airing around the world.</b>

34:40.110 --> 34:41.370
<b>Worst comes to worst…</b>

34:41.450 --> 34:44.620
<b>Maybe you should try to accept reality.</b>

34:45.410 --> 34:49.540
<b>Stop clinging to your dreams and make do
with what you can in the real world.</b>

34:49.620 --> 34:51.960
<b>It's for your own good.</b>

34:54.300 --> 34:57.050
<b>I brought presents for everybody!</b>

34:58.130 --> 35:00.010
<b>Welcome home, dear.</b>

35:00.090 --> 35:01.340
<b>How was your day at work?</b>

35:01.430 --> 35:02.510
<b>Everything's good.</b>

35:15.730 --> 35:17.150
<b>Is this where I think it is?</b>

35:25.200 --> 35:26.040
<b>I knew it!</b>

35:26.620 --> 35:28.160
<b>So the rumors were true!</b>

35:29.040 --> 35:31.580
<b>You're creepy, Nathan!</b>

35:39.050 --> 35:41.300
<b>You're saying
he's going to stay like this forever?</b>

35:41.380 --> 35:45.300
<b>His brainwaves are identical
to a state of shallow sleep.</b>

35:45.390 --> 35:48.350
<b>Whether or not he'll come out of it
is up to him.</b>

35:48.930 --> 35:52.230
<b>The other victims exhibit
the same symptoms as Fire Emblem.</b>

35:52.310 --> 35:55.110
<b>None have regained consciousness.</b>

35:56.520 --> 35:57.860
<b>The sleeping sickness.</b>

35:57.940 --> 36:00.860
<b>Just like in the legend.</b>

36:00.950 --> 36:02.360
<b>Who are those guys?</b>

36:02.950 --> 36:04.200
<b>What is it they're after?</b>

36:04.280 --> 36:06.120
<b><i>Maybe they're trying</i>
<i>to start a revolution.</i></b>

36:06.200 --> 36:07.790
<b>A revolution?</b>

36:07.870 --> 36:09.250
<b><i>According to the legend,</i></b>

36:09.330 --> 36:12.460
<b><i>the Goddess brought calamity</i>
<i>to make people repent.</i></b>

36:13.170 --> 36:15.170
<b>When you consider that
none of these incidents</b>

36:15.250 --> 36:16.420
<b>led to any casualties…</b>

36:17.040 --> 36:18.380
<b>It's a white-collar crime.</b>

36:18.920 --> 36:24.390
<b>Tell me, so what does this "Goddess"
do in the legend?</b>

36:25.680 --> 36:27.010
<b>You don't know?</b>

36:27.100 --> 36:31.100
<b>Of course not. I'm not from here.</b>

36:31.180 --> 36:32.140
<b>So, what does she do?</b>

36:35.020 --> 36:37.900
<b>Despite suffering the Goddess's wrath,</b>

36:37.980 --> 36:41.650
<b><i>the people still did not learn</i>
<i>to change their ways.</i></b>

36:42.240 --> 36:45.030
<b><i>Finally, the Goddess decided</i>
<i>to return everything to nothingness</i></b>

36:45.110 --> 36:48.740
<b><i>by opening a cavernous abyss</i>
<i>deep enough to engulf the entire village.</i></b>

36:49.490 --> 36:51.580
<b><i>Buried beneath the eternal darkness,</i></b>

36:51.660 --> 36:55.170
<b><i>the villagers finally learned</i>
<i>the error of their ways,</i></b>

36:55.250 --> 36:57.630
<b><i>and began to carry a heart of justice.</i></b>

36:57.710 --> 36:58.840
<b><i>Say what?</i></b>

36:58.920 --> 37:02.220
<b>You mean a hole is going to open
under the city next?</b>

37:02.300 --> 37:03.420
<b>Sheesh!</b>

37:06.640 --> 37:09.640
<b><i>We'll assume that mysterious old man</i>
<i>has the power to put people to sleep.</i></b>

37:09.720 --> 37:12.640
<b><i>And the man who looked like a boxer</i>
<i>was causing that sound, correct?</i></b>

37:12.730 --> 37:13.730
<b>Yeah.</b>

37:13.810 --> 37:16.600
<b>Those sounds were definitely
made by that guy.</b>

37:16.690 --> 37:19.230
<b><i>We believe the woman</i>
<i>can create duplicates of herself.</i></b>

37:19.820 --> 37:21.860
<b>That leaves only
the question of the Goddess.</b>

37:22.490 --> 37:24.740
<b>Do you really think their goal
is to start a revolution?</b>

37:24.820 --> 37:28.240
<b>Regardless, everything will
become clear tomorrow.</b>

37:28.320 --> 37:30.030
<b>-Huh?
-Tomorrow is the day</b>

37:30.120 --> 37:32.830
<b>the Goddess is said to have opened
the abyss to bury the village.</b>

37:32.910 --> 37:34.410
<b>It's Justice Day.</b>

37:38.420 --> 37:42.260
<b><i>There are so many events happening</i>
<i>on this year's Justice Day.</i></b>

37:42.340 --> 37:46.340
<b><i>Yes, it's the biggest event</i>
<i>celebrating that legendary day.</i></b>

37:46.430 --> 37:48.430
<b><i>I came here on a date back in the day.</i></b>

37:49.140 --> 37:53.180
<b><i>Please come on out</i>
<i>to tomorrow's Justice Festival.</i></b>

37:53.770 --> 37:54.890
<b>I see.</b>

37:54.980 --> 37:58.270
<b>Yes. We believe it's morally questionable.</b>

37:59.150 --> 38:00.940
<b>I will inform Mr. Schneider as such.</b>

38:01.020 --> 38:03.230
<b>If we need anything else,
we'll ask your help.</b>

38:03.320 --> 38:05.070
<b>-May I ask you one question?
-Yes?</b>

38:05.860 --> 38:08.610
<b>Don't the employees have issues</b>

38:08.700 --> 38:11.240
<b>with Mr. Schneider's
management philosophy?</b>

38:11.870 --> 38:14.250
<b>We could go on and on
about business philosophy.</b>

38:22.210 --> 38:25.090
<b>Hey! Don't pick out the pickles!</b>

38:26.510 --> 38:28.430
<b>Wow.</b>

38:28.510 --> 38:30.970
<b>Every newscast is doing
special reports on the festival.</b>

38:31.550 --> 38:33.930
<b>The ratings are going up tomorrow
for sure.</b>

38:34.020 --> 38:38.270
<b>Before thinking about ratings,
please don't forget that we're heroes.</b>

38:38.350 --> 38:40.020
<b>-There you go again.
-Huh?</b>

38:40.100 --> 38:44.480
<b>For a young guy, Junior, you sure act
like such a square sometimes.</b>

38:44.570 --> 38:45.400
<b>Huh?</b>

38:45.480 --> 38:47.740
<b>Is it your previous partner's influence?</b>

38:49.200 --> 38:51.450
<b>Don't compare me with that guy too much.</b>

38:51.530 --> 38:53.950
<b>I'm me, Golden Ryan.</b>

38:54.540 --> 38:56.250
<b>I'm not comparing the two of you.</b>

38:56.330 --> 38:59.540
<b>He and I aren't partners anymore.</b>

39:00.120 --> 39:01.540
<b>If you say so.</b>

39:14.890 --> 39:17.270
<b><i>Our concern is for Fire Emblem,</i></b>

39:17.350 --> 39:19.310
<b><i>-who remains unconscious.</i>
-What?</b>

39:19.390 --> 39:23.310
<b><i>I hope to see him back healthy</i>
<i>as soon as possible.</i></b>

39:53.340 --> 39:54.350
<b>He finally shows up.</b>

39:55.180 --> 39:56.890
<b>How is he?</b>

39:56.970 --> 39:58.350
<b>See for yourself.</b>

40:00.060 --> 40:01.560
<b>So you're a cab driver now?</b>

40:02.440 --> 40:04.690
<b>-Huh?
-I saw it on the Internet.</b>

40:04.770 --> 40:05.860
<b>Yeah…</b>

40:05.940 --> 40:10.280
<b>Gosh, they write everything there.</b>

40:11.070 --> 40:14.530
<b>I said I'd be a hero until the very end,</b>

40:14.620 --> 40:16.990
<b>but it's hard
when the public won't recognize you.</b>

40:17.080 --> 40:19.120
<b>Who cares what the public thinks of you?</b>

40:19.870 --> 40:22.500
<b>I used to think that way too
when I was a kid.</b>

40:22.580 --> 40:24.960
<b>But reality is harsh.</b>

40:26.630 --> 40:30.760
<b>Bunny kept talking about money, money…</b>

40:30.840 --> 40:34.220
<b>I used to think
that's not what heroes are about,</b>

40:34.300 --> 40:38.510
<b>but unlike me,
he had a firm eye on reality.</b>

40:38.600 --> 40:40.770
<b>-You don't get it at all.
-Huh?</b>

40:40.850 --> 40:43.350
<b>What about him
were you looking at, anyway?</b>

40:43.850 --> 40:46.360
<b>Barnaby is pursuing his ideals.</b>

40:46.900 --> 40:49.820
<b>When I was
at the Justice Festival admin office…</b>

40:49.900 --> 40:52.400
<b>You're here for tickets to the parade?</b>

40:52.950 --> 40:53.780
<b>Yes.</b>

40:53.860 --> 40:55.660
<b>Are you also gifting them, Blue Rose?</b>

40:55.740 --> 40:58.450
<b>You heroes are so nice.</b>

40:58.530 --> 40:59.790
<b>Huh?</b>

40:59.870 --> 41:02.250
<b>The other day, Barnaby also came by</b>

41:02.330 --> 41:04.580
<b>so that he could invite children
from the orphanage.</b>

41:06.670 --> 41:09.800
<b>Ever since the Maverick incident,
it seems he's been doing a lot</b>

41:09.880 --> 41:13.090
<b>to help children like himself
who don't have parents.</b>

41:13.170 --> 41:16.140
<b>So that's why Bunny
was so obsessed with money?</b>

41:17.510 --> 41:19.390
<b>Why didn't he say so?</b>

41:20.890 --> 41:23.390
<b>Says the guy
who hides his feelings the most.</b>

41:24.940 --> 41:28.190
<b>You have to admit,
he's starting to act just like you.</b>

41:30.190 --> 41:31.570
<b>Sorry, excuse me.</b>

41:33.900 --> 41:35.950
<b>Geez, he's such a dummy.</b>

41:42.370 --> 41:44.580
<b><i>The First League does pay better.</i></b>

41:44.660 --> 41:46.830
<b><i>You just see things differently than I do.</i></b>

41:46.920 --> 41:50.670
<b><i>Maybe it's time we go our separate ways.</i></b>

42:02.970 --> 42:05.600
<b>Patrol? Are you nuts?</b>

42:05.680 --> 42:08.690
<b>A lot of people
are looking forward to tomorrow.</b>

42:08.770 --> 42:10.650
<b>It's okay, I can do this myself.</b>

42:10.730 --> 42:13.030
<b>Not a chance, Junior.</b>

42:13.110 --> 42:15.690
<b>That'll only help boost
your own public image.</b>

42:15.780 --> 42:16.700
<b>Huh?</b>

42:16.780 --> 42:19.200
<b>Can't have you hog
all the glory for yourself.</b>

42:19.780 --> 42:20.990
<b>I simply want to…</b>

42:21.080 --> 42:24.330
<b>…protect the citizens, right?</b>

42:27.920 --> 42:29.210
<b>-Let's go.
-Right.</b>

42:43.890 --> 42:46.730
<b>Face-to-face, man to man!</b>

43:01.030 --> 43:02.160
<b>Dad!</b>

43:02.830 --> 43:04.160
<b>Oh!</b>

43:04.240 --> 43:05.660
<b>Kaede!</b>

43:05.740 --> 43:07.000
<b>Huh?</b>

43:07.080 --> 43:08.830
<b>I knew you'd try that.</b>

43:08.910 --> 43:10.540
<b>Stop doing that.</b>

43:10.620 --> 43:13.040
<b>But Kaede!</b>

43:13.130 --> 43:14.880
<b>You haven't changed.</b>

43:14.960 --> 43:15.880
<b>I'll say.</b>

43:15.960 --> 43:17.840
<b>You're doing better than I expected.</b>

43:17.920 --> 43:21.260
<b>You surprised me when you said
you were coming to see me out of the blue.</b>

43:21.340 --> 43:23.890
<b>-Are we getting in your way?
-Huh?</b>

43:24.470 --> 43:26.390
<b>Of course not!</b>

43:54.250 --> 43:55.960
<b>-What's taking them so long?
<i>-Dear visitors.</i></b>

43:56.050 --> 43:59.470
<b><i>The Justice Parade will be starting soon.</i></b>

44:00.470 --> 44:03.720
<b>C'mon, if we don't hurry,
we won't be able to get a spot!</b>

44:03.800 --> 44:06.470
<b>It's okay. We don't have to rush.</b>

44:06.560 --> 44:07.430
<b>But…</b>

44:07.930 --> 44:09.350
<b>-Ta-dah!
-What?</b>

44:10.270 --> 44:12.100
<b>Luxury box seats?</b>

44:12.770 --> 44:14.900
<b>Miss Blue Rose got them for us.</b>

44:15.440 --> 44:16.360
<b>What?</b>

44:17.110 --> 44:18.360
<b>To tell you the truth,</b>

44:19.030 --> 44:22.700
<b>she's the one who suggested
I should come and see you.</b>

44:23.240 --> 44:24.370
<b>I see.</b>

44:24.950 --> 44:27.080
<b>So that's why she went
to the admin office.</b>

44:32.750 --> 44:35.830
<b>Oh, by the way, how's your homework
assignment coming along?</b>

44:35.920 --> 44:37.420
<b>That poem about the sun.</b>

44:37.500 --> 44:38.670
<b>Oh, that.</b>

44:39.170 --> 44:41.300
<b>I don't have talent.</b>

44:41.880 --> 44:43.260
<b>No matter how hard I try,</b>

44:43.340 --> 44:46.640
<b>I can't seem to write something
like the teacher's favorite poem.</b>

44:47.220 --> 44:49.520
<b>You don't have to imitate it, you know?</b>

44:49.600 --> 44:51.980
<b>But I'll get a higher score that way.</b>

44:53.560 --> 44:55.400
<b>I think it's better
to write an honest poem</b>

44:55.480 --> 44:57.900
<b>about what you feel like writing about.</b>

44:58.940 --> 45:03.070
<b>Doing what you can, isn't that enough?</b>

45:04.110 --> 45:06.200
<b>That's what Daddy's always done.</b>

45:09.910 --> 45:11.120
<b>Are you sure about that?</b>

45:11.200 --> 45:12.830
<b>What do you mean?</b>

45:12.910 --> 45:15.120
<b>Right now, are you doing
what you want to do?</b>

45:15.210 --> 45:17.460
<b>Are you doing everything you can do?</b>

45:17.540 --> 45:19.500
<b>Even today, weren't you really</b>

45:19.590 --> 45:21.420
<b>thinking about wanting to be a hero?</b>

45:23.130 --> 45:26.340
<b>You force yourself to look happy,
but I can see right through you.</b>

45:27.470 --> 45:30.260
<b>I don't know all the details,</b>

45:30.350 --> 45:33.060
<b>but if you want to be a hero,
then you should do it.</b>

45:33.140 --> 45:35.690
<b>It's what's best for you, Dad.</b>

45:36.400 --> 45:37.270
<b>That's what I think.</b>

45:38.440 --> 45:40.070
<b>Don't worry about me.</b>

45:40.730 --> 45:43.490
<b>I'm also a NEXT,
so I can look after myself.</b>

45:44.490 --> 45:45.900
<b>Now hurry and go.</b>

45:51.410 --> 45:53.450
<b>You're starting to become
just like your mother.</b>

45:55.290 --> 45:58.500
<b>Tomoe used to support me the same way.</b>

45:59.540 --> 46:00.500
<b>Really?</b>

46:01.170 --> 46:02.090
<b>Thanks.</b>

46:04.010 --> 46:05.220
<b>If you need me, call.</b>

46:05.300 --> 46:07.010
<b>-Never mind, just go!
-Right!</b>

46:39.080 --> 46:41.540
<b>Looks like everyone's having a blast.</b>

46:41.630 --> 46:43.000
<b>Concentrate.</b>

46:46.760 --> 46:48.590
<b>Look at that! Isn't it awesome?</b>

46:49.260 --> 46:53.600
<b>What is Kotetsu planning to do anyway?</b>

46:53.680 --> 46:56.980
<b>He's not officially recognized
as a hero, right?</b>

46:57.060 --> 46:58.310
<b>Don't worry!</b>

46:58.890 --> 47:00.020
<b>Dad will be fine!</b>

47:14.370 --> 47:15.790
<b>Hey, how'd you get in here?</b>

47:21.830 --> 47:23.040
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

47:30.090 --> 47:30.930
<b>They're here.</b>

47:31.510 --> 47:33.800
<b>Bonjour, Heroes.
It's going down just as we predicted.</b>

47:34.600 --> 47:37.640
<b><i>Apprehend them on sight.</i>
<i>Make it look good.</i></b>

47:39.350 --> 47:40.520
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

48:21.350 --> 48:22.640
<b>Everybody, remain calm!</b>

48:28.190 --> 48:29.990
<b>Where are they?!</b>

48:30.070 --> 48:32.070
<b>-This way, quickly!
-Right!</b>

48:35.410 --> 48:37.910
<b>-Kaede!
-Kaede!</b>

48:50.210 --> 48:51.970
<b><i>The underground control room was hit.</i></b>

48:52.050 --> 48:54.430
<b>Target them as they reach ground level.</b>

48:57.970 --> 49:00.680
<b>Hey, Miss Producer! There's no one here.</b>

49:00.770 --> 49:01.770
<b>Barnaby?</b>

49:03.350 --> 49:05.730
<b>Kaede! What are you doing here?</b>

49:05.810 --> 49:08.770
<b>Young lady, did you see
any suspicious characters around?</b>

49:08.860 --> 49:11.900
<b>Huh? I did. Three very suspicious people
went that way.</b>

49:12.780 --> 49:14.150
<b>There you are!</b>

49:14.660 --> 49:16.820
<b>You need to go quickly to somewhere safe.</b>

49:20.330 --> 49:22.040
<b>He's so hot.</b>

49:23.750 --> 49:27.210
<b>Be honest with me.
You thought I was the culprit, didn't you?</b>

49:27.290 --> 49:29.170
<b>-Huh?
-You actually thought</b>

49:29.250 --> 49:31.170
<b>I was going to open up the hole.</b>

49:31.250 --> 49:32.300
<b>No, I never did.</b>

49:32.380 --> 49:33.800
<b>You sure?</b>

49:33.880 --> 49:34.880
<b>Careful.</b>

49:34.970 --> 49:37.470
<b><i>You're the type who shows it on your face.</i></b>

49:37.970 --> 49:40.010
<b>Ryan and Barnaby found the suspects.</b>

49:40.600 --> 49:41.850
<b><i>After them, everybody!</i></b>

49:42.470 --> 49:43.640
<b>There!</b>

49:43.730 --> 49:46.310
<b><i>Welcome to Hero TV Live!</i></b>

49:46.400 --> 49:49.110
<b><i>Our heroes are already</i>
<i>in pursuit of the suspects!</i></b>

49:50.150 --> 49:53.570
<b><i>And it looks like these criminals</i>
<i>have scattered.</i></b>

49:53.650 --> 49:56.070
<b><i>Our heroes are splitting up in pursuit.</i></b>

49:56.610 --> 50:00.580
<b><i>However, there still seems</i>
<i>to be no sign of Blue Rose.</i></b>

50:01.370 --> 50:03.580
<b>I'm counting on you, everyone.</b>

50:05.790 --> 50:07.670
<b>What?! No, wait!</b>

50:07.750 --> 50:09.790
<b>Please! Try to calm down!</b>

50:13.590 --> 50:14.760
<b>Tiger?!</b>

50:14.840 --> 50:17.340
<b>Leave him to me.
Hurry and go get the criminals!</b>

50:17.430 --> 50:19.800
<b>You can't contain him with just that!</b>

50:19.890 --> 50:23.180
<b>Don't worry. I can manage for a while.</b>

50:23.810 --> 50:25.600
<b>Where'd you get all this?</b>

50:25.680 --> 50:28.940
<b>-Thanks for everything, Blue Rose.
-Huh?</b>

50:29.690 --> 50:31.400
<b>You've brought me to my senses.</b>

50:33.650 --> 50:35.570
<b>Now hurry and get going!</b>

50:36.070 --> 50:37.530
<b>Stop bossing me around.</b>

50:38.280 --> 50:40.660
<b>And by the way,
your belly's starting to grow!</b>

50:40.740 --> 50:41.700
<b>Oh, shut up!</b>

50:47.290 --> 50:48.790
<b>Where the hell did she go?</b>

50:48.870 --> 50:51.170
<b>I'm right over here.</b>

50:53.710 --> 50:54.590
<b>Stop!</b>

50:55.210 --> 50:57.840
<b>You make my heart throb every time.</b>

51:01.800 --> 51:03.810
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

51:05.600 --> 51:10.600
<b>Such a brave young child
to come after me all by yourself.</b>

51:10.690 --> 51:11.650
<b>Excuse me?</b>

51:12.110 --> 51:13.980
<b>I'm here, too!</b>

51:17.150 --> 51:20.200
<b><i>There she is! Blue Rose</i>
<i>finally makes her appearance!</i></b>

51:21.320 --> 51:24.490
<b>-We'll make short work of this jerk!
<i>-</i>Right!</b>

51:28.500 --> 51:31.540
<b>I will no longer allow you
to have your way!</b>

51:33.210 --> 51:36.340
<b>Prepare for defeat!</b>

51:38.920 --> 51:41.340
<b>My heart is really solid as a rock!</b>

51:41.930 --> 51:44.850
<b>And your crime
has been completely put on lock!</b>

51:44.930 --> 51:46.100
<b>What?</b>

51:46.180 --> 51:47.430
<b><i>That was bad!</i></b>

51:47.520 --> 51:50.690
<b><i>Rock Bison just stole</i>
<i>Blue Rose's signature catchphrase!</i></b>

51:51.190 --> 51:54.150
<b>Never mind these guys!
Show more of my people!</b>

51:54.230 --> 51:56.900
<b><i>But the agreement is</i>
<i>to give all heroes equal air time…</i></b>

51:56.980 --> 52:00.570
<b>I have the final say in all matters.</b>

52:00.650 --> 52:03.030
<b>You do understand what that means,
don't you?</b>

52:03.120 --> 52:05.280
<b>Yes. As you wish.</b>

52:11.830 --> 52:16.290
<b>Ryan and Barnaby
have cornered one of the suspects!</b>

52:16.960 --> 52:18.300
<b>There's no escape.</b>

52:20.050 --> 52:22.970
<b>Will it be as simple as that?</b>

52:32.310 --> 52:36.650
<b>That was close! Her circular blades
sliced right through the display!</b>

52:37.230 --> 52:39.530
<b>I guess it's only your face that's cute.</b>

52:41.110 --> 52:42.320
<b>I'm honored</b>

52:42.400 --> 52:47.200
<b>to have two handsome princes for company.</b>

52:52.250 --> 52:55.540
<b>-Which one do you wanna take, Junior?
-No time for jokes!</b>

53:06.140 --> 53:07.470
<b>That's all wrong.</b>

53:07.550 --> 53:11.220
<b>You have to keep your eyes on the girl
if you want her to fall for you.</b>

53:11.310 --> 53:13.520
<b>Then I'll make you fall for me,</b>

53:14.230 --> 53:15.480
<b>in two different ways!</b>

53:26.820 --> 53:29.410
<b>Looks like you can't reach me up here,
can you?</b>

53:30.200 --> 53:34.460
<b>Women do research on the people they love.</b>

53:51.810 --> 53:54.850
<b>Please, no more!</b>

54:00.070 --> 54:01.070
<b>Hot!</b>

54:08.070 --> 54:09.740
<b>What's the matter, guys?</b>

54:10.450 --> 54:12.910
<b>That's a really annoying power he's got.</b>

54:13.660 --> 54:16.670
<b>Sky High!</b>

54:23.130 --> 54:26.720
<b>You're wasting your time.
You can't shut out my sound.</b>

54:33.470 --> 54:37.350
<b>Coming from behind like that…
you play dirty!</b>

54:58.040 --> 55:01.290
<b>Well, it's all over for you guys.</b>

55:03.670 --> 55:07.220
<b>Look at that, your friend's running away.</b>

55:08.880 --> 55:11.720
<b><i>This is unprecedented!</i></b>

55:11.800 --> 55:14.060
<b><i>Origami Cyclone is fleeing the scene!</i></b>

55:34.660 --> 55:36.120
<b>Prepare for your end!</b>

55:38.200 --> 55:41.790
<b>Isn't it you
who needs to prepare for the end?</b>

55:43.750 --> 55:44.750
<b>No way!</b>

55:51.680 --> 55:54.720
<b>You people just don't know when to quit.</b>

55:58.020 --> 56:02.400
<b>You know, you can't capture me
if you're running away.</b>

56:02.480 --> 56:03.730
<b>Shut up!</b>

56:03.810 --> 56:05.440
<b>We'll capture you no matter what!</b>

56:05.520 --> 56:08.780
<b>That's right! You're gonna pay
for what you did to Fire Emblem!</b>

56:08.860 --> 56:11.650
<b>There seems to be a misunderstanding.</b>

56:11.740 --> 56:16.910
<b>All I did was reawaken the trauma
that he needs to overcome.</b>

56:16.990 --> 56:20.660
<b>-What?
-And the only way to awaken him</b>

56:20.750 --> 56:23.040
<b>is to defeat me!</b>

56:23.120 --> 56:25.920
<b>Now stop running away!</b>

56:31.840 --> 56:33.680
<b>I can't stand it anymore! Help me!</b>

56:34.300 --> 56:36.220
<b><i>Nobody's going to help you.</i></b>

56:36.810 --> 56:38.810
<b><i>You're used to being alone, aren't you?</i></b>

56:40.640 --> 56:43.100
<b>You brought all of this on yourself.</b>

56:43.230 --> 56:44.150
<b>Papa?</b>

56:44.230 --> 56:46.520
<b>We raised you with all our love,</b>

56:46.610 --> 56:48.900
<b>but you betrayed us.</b>

56:48.980 --> 56:50.150
<b>Mama!</b>

56:50.240 --> 56:54.030
<b>Aren't you the one
who's most ashamed of yourself?</b>

56:55.370 --> 56:57.160
<b>If that's the case, why not just die?</b>

57:04.370 --> 57:07.710
<b>The flames are getting stronger!</b>

57:07.790 --> 57:09.840
<b><i>Our heroes are being toyed with.</i></b>

57:09.920 --> 57:12.170
<b><i>They're still unable</i>
<i>to capture the criminals!</i></b>

57:12.760 --> 57:16.140
<b>These guys are putting on quite a show.</b>

57:16.800 --> 57:17.760
<b>What is it?</b>

57:17.850 --> 57:21.560
<b>Something just doesn't feel right.</b>

57:22.850 --> 57:26.230
<b>It's as though the suspects are purposely
allowing the heroes to catch up to them.</b>

57:26.810 --> 57:29.230
<b>Huh? Why would they do that?</b>

57:29.320 --> 57:32.990
<b>For example,
they're using themselves as decoys</b>

57:33.070 --> 57:34.780
<b>to keep the heroes busy.</b>

57:34.860 --> 57:35.700
<b>Yes!</b>

57:35.780 --> 57:41.580
<b>So you're saying that these guys
aren't just trying to recreate the legend?</b>

57:42.200 --> 57:43.370
<b>I doubt that.</b>

57:44.210 --> 57:46.330
<b>I'll inform Agnes just to be safe.</b>

57:46.420 --> 57:48.250
<b>I'll notify the police.</b>

57:48.330 --> 57:52.010
<b>As long as they make it interesting,
who cares?</b>

58:06.440 --> 58:09.190
<b>What are you?</b>

58:12.110 --> 58:13.780
<b>Virgil! Ben!</b>

58:22.120 --> 58:24.540
<b>Somebody! Hey, somebody!</b>

58:24.620 --> 58:26.330
<b>Do something!</b>

58:36.670 --> 58:39.260
<b>What does he want now?</b>

58:39.840 --> 58:40.930
<b>Can I help you, sir?</b>

58:41.010 --> 58:44.180
<b><i>Agnes! Send a hero</i>
<i>over here immediately!</i></b>

58:44.270 --> 58:45.350
<b><i>Excuse me?</i></b>

58:45.430 --> 58:46.770
<b>I'm being attacked!</b>

58:46.850 --> 58:47.730
<b><i>Who is?</i></b>

58:47.810 --> 58:49.560
<b>Me! I am!</b>

58:49.650 --> 58:52.270
<b>I'm the one they were after!</b>

58:53.070 --> 58:54.440
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

58:55.190 --> 58:56.950
<b>Never mind! Just do as I tell you!</b>

58:57.450 --> 59:00.620
<b><i>You can use anyone from the program!</i></b>

59:00.700 --> 59:01.740
<b>Right away, sir!</b>

59:04.830 --> 59:06.290
<b>Mr. Schneider's under attack?</b>

59:06.370 --> 59:08.330
<b><i>Yes! Head over there immediately!</i></b>

59:08.920 --> 59:11.830
<b>Given the situation,
I don't know if we can…</b>

59:13.170 --> 59:15.000
<b>There's no way we can go either!</b>

59:20.510 --> 59:21.640
<b>Take care of things here.</b>

59:22.180 --> 59:24.680
<b>Hey! What are you talking about?</b>

59:25.270 --> 59:27.730
<b>You heard what's going on.
Mr. Schneider is…</b>

59:27.810 --> 59:29.190
<b>Then I'll go!</b>

59:29.270 --> 59:31.440
<b>It's a chance to make a name for myself!</b>

59:31.520 --> 59:34.610
<b>No cheating on me!</b>

59:42.660 --> 59:43.490
<b>Huh?</b>

59:44.490 --> 59:48.910
<b>If even one of you leaves, I might
do something to hurt the citizens.</b>

59:53.380 --> 59:55.750
<b>Is it possible
that what you're really after is…</b>

59:56.750 --> 59:59.630
<b>Hey, Agnes! What's going on?!
Aren't they here yet?</b>

01:00:01.050 --> 01:00:03.090
<b>I'm doing the best I can…</b>

01:00:03.180 --> 01:00:06.010
<b><i>Do anything it takes. Just hurry!</i></b>

01:00:06.100 --> 01:00:08.270
<b>In that case, I have an idea.</b>

01:00:08.350 --> 01:00:09.390
<b>Do it!</b>

01:00:09.480 --> 01:00:12.690
<b>I'll leave everything to you!
Do something!</b>

01:00:12.770 --> 01:00:14.190
<b>Oh, Mr. Schneider…</b>

01:00:15.860 --> 01:00:16.690
<b>Huh?</b>

01:00:29.750 --> 01:00:31.000
<b><i>Hello? Tiger?</i></b>

01:00:31.080 --> 01:00:32.920
<b>The Justice Bureau gave us the go.</b>

01:00:33.420 --> 01:00:35.790
<b>For one day only, you're back to being
a Second League hero.</b>

01:00:35.880 --> 01:00:38.130
<b>What?! Why the sudden change?!</b>

01:00:38.210 --> 01:00:41.090
<b><i>Our owner gave me the okay</i>
<i>to handle everything.</i></b>

01:00:41.170 --> 01:00:42.430
<b>Are you serious?!</b>

01:00:42.510 --> 01:00:44.090
<b>If you put on a good show,</b>

01:00:44.180 --> 01:00:45.970
<b>you might be reinstated
to the Second League.</b>

01:00:46.050 --> 01:00:49.850
<b>Okay, but I have my hands full right now.</b>

01:00:49.930 --> 01:00:51.980
<b>Let us take care of things here!</b>

01:00:52.770 --> 01:00:55.860
<b>Mr. Tiger, show us how it's done.</b>

01:00:55.940 --> 01:00:57.440
<b>Please hurry!</b>

01:01:00.740 --> 01:01:02.780
<b>-I'm counting on you guys!
-Yes, sir!</b>

01:01:03.490 --> 01:01:07.620
<b>You say a lot of things, but in the end,
you trust Tiger, don't you?</b>

01:01:07.700 --> 01:01:11.080
<b>Huh? The Second League
was a project I put together.</b>

01:01:11.580 --> 01:01:13.920
<b>I'm not going to let it
get squashed so easily!</b>

01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:20.090
<b>There you are!</b>

01:01:21.800 --> 01:01:23.680
<b>Hurry up and get in, Tiger!</b>

01:01:23.760 --> 01:01:25.130
<b>Mr. Saito!</b>

01:01:44.860 --> 01:01:45.740
<b>All right!</b>

01:01:47.370 --> 01:01:49.370
<b>Time for a Wild Roar!</b>

01:01:50.030 --> 01:01:51.120
<b>Listen up, everybody.</b>

01:01:51.200 --> 01:01:54.080
<b>Just now, I've reinstated Tiger
for one day only.</b>

01:01:54.160 --> 01:01:56.330
<b>If you don't want him
to steal all the glory,</b>

01:01:56.420 --> 01:01:58.790
<b>make sure you take care
of the targets in front of you.</b>

01:01:58.880 --> 01:02:00.000
<b><i>Got that?!</i></b>

01:02:00.090 --> 01:02:02.260
<b>Oh, yeah! It's about time, Kotetsu!</b>

01:02:02.340 --> 01:02:03.340
<b>Welcome back!</b>

01:02:03.420 --> 01:02:04.880
<b>Welcome back, Tiger!</b>

01:02:04.970 --> 01:02:08.180
<b>Just try not to get in my way, okay?</b>

01:02:09.100 --> 01:02:10.220
<b>I know!</b>

01:02:12.100 --> 01:02:13.560
<b>That must be it…</b>

01:02:14.140 --> 01:02:16.350
<b>Put me down!</b>

01:02:17.310 --> 01:02:20.610
<b>Is it money? If it's money,
I'll get you anything you want!.</b>

01:02:21.520 --> 01:02:22.940
<b>Go!</b>

01:02:24.990 --> 01:02:26.900
<b>Hey! Over here!</b>

01:02:28.280 --> 01:02:29.780
<b>Hurry and rescue me!</b>

01:02:48.630 --> 01:02:51.550
<b>What do they think
that old man's going to be able to do?</b>

01:02:55.180 --> 01:02:58.600
<b>I think it's about time for your knockout.</b>

01:02:58.690 --> 01:03:00.400
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

01:03:01.020 --> 01:03:04.570
<b>Yeah. Tiger would laugh at us</b>

01:03:04.650 --> 01:03:06.820
<b>if he heard we let a bastard like you win.</b>

01:03:13.200 --> 01:03:17.580
<b>We can't lie around when
that middle-aged man is doing his best…</b>

01:03:17.660 --> 01:03:18.960
<b>Good point.</b>

01:03:19.040 --> 01:03:23.250
<b>Oh come on. Why don't
you people go to sleep already,</b>

01:03:23.840 --> 01:03:29.220
<b>like that coward
who's neither guy nor girl.</b>

01:03:29.300 --> 01:03:31.340
<b>What did you just say?</b>

01:03:33.140 --> 01:03:34.600
<b><i>Queer.</i></b>

01:03:34.680 --> 01:03:35.930
<b><i>You ungrateful child.</i></b>

01:03:36.020 --> 01:03:37.310
<b><i>You ungrateful child.</i></b>

01:03:37.390 --> 01:03:39.690
<b><i>Is what I am so wrong?</i></b>

01:03:42.230 --> 01:03:44.150
<b><i>I can't take it anymore!</i></b>

01:03:44.230 --> 01:03:46.070
<b><i>No more…</i></b>

01:03:46.940 --> 01:03:49.740
<b>You don't know anything about him!</b>

01:03:50.530 --> 01:03:53.160
<b>Never talk like that about Fire!</b>

01:03:53.740 --> 01:03:56.910
<b><i>I've never met any other person like Fire,</i></b>

01:03:57.500 --> 01:04:00.080
<b><i>who is strong like a man,</i></b>

01:04:00.160 --> 01:04:03.130
<b><i>but also warm and gentle like a woman!</i></b>

01:04:04.920 --> 01:04:08.090
<b>There isn't a more wonderful person
than he is!</b>

01:04:14.930 --> 01:04:16.850
<b>I'm such a fool.</b>

01:04:17.720 --> 01:04:19.930
<b>Why am I worried about all this now?</b>

01:04:21.020 --> 01:04:24.860
<b>Okay, that's enough. Show's over.</b>

01:04:24.940 --> 01:04:27.110
<b>After all, this is who I am, right?</b>

01:04:29.150 --> 01:04:31.610
<b>I'm happy I was born me.</b>

01:04:34.820 --> 01:04:36.030
<b>It's fine this way.</b>

01:04:37.580 --> 01:04:39.580
<b>I am who I am!</b>

01:04:44.790 --> 01:04:48.460
<b>A man covered in bruises… I like it.</b>

01:04:48.550 --> 01:04:51.720
<b>Hey, why won't you use your powers?</b>

01:04:51.800 --> 01:04:54.220
<b>I can't do anything when I don't
even know who's the real one.</b>

01:04:54.300 --> 01:04:56.600
<b>All we can do right now
is figure a way out of this</b>

01:04:56.680 --> 01:04:58.060
<b>while avoiding her attacks.</b>

01:04:58.140 --> 01:05:01.180
<b>On my signal, take shelter over there!</b>

01:05:01.270 --> 01:05:02.100
<b>What?</b>

01:05:02.180 --> 01:05:04.850
<b>Listen to your partner for a change.</b>

01:05:05.940 --> 01:05:06.860
<b>Go!</b>

01:05:09.110 --> 01:05:11.320
<b><i>Is Barnaby following Origami Cyclone</i></b>

01:05:11.400 --> 01:05:13.280
<b><i>and leaving the scene as well?</i></b>

01:05:14.860 --> 01:05:17.450
<b>I said I wouldn't let you get away!</b>

01:05:20.540 --> 01:05:22.290
<b>Now then…</b>

01:05:22.870 --> 01:05:25.120
<b>Wham!</b>

01:05:25.830 --> 01:05:28.420
<b>Activating your powers from there
won't do you any good.</b>

01:05:39.390 --> 01:05:40.390
<b>What?</b>

01:05:45.770 --> 01:05:47.560
<b><i>What's happening?!</i></b>

01:05:47.650 --> 01:05:50.190
<b><i>Ryan has extended his gravitational field!</i></b>

01:05:52.070 --> 01:05:54.820
<b>Make it fast, Junior!</b>

01:06:03.910 --> 01:06:05.580
<b><i>They've done it!</i></b>

01:06:05.670 --> 01:06:06.830
<b><i>After a hard-fought battle,</i></b>

01:06:06.920 --> 01:06:09.590
<b><i>Ryan and Barnaby</i>
<i>have apprehended the suspect!</i></b>

01:06:17.220 --> 01:06:21.560
<b>Looks like King of Heroes is just a name.</b>

01:06:28.810 --> 01:06:30.480
<b>That's not going to happen!</b>

01:06:30.560 --> 01:06:33.990
<b><i>I don't believe it!</i>
<i>Origami Cyclone is back!</i></b>

01:06:34.070 --> 01:06:35.320
<b>Origami!</b>

01:06:35.400 --> 01:06:36.450
<b>You…</b>

01:06:36.530 --> 01:06:40.030
<b>I would never run away
and leave my friends behind!</b>

01:06:40.120 --> 01:06:41.990
<b>Well, good for you.</b>

01:06:42.080 --> 01:06:45.450
<b>But what can you do?</b>

01:07:02.350 --> 01:07:03.680
<b>What just happened?</b>

01:07:03.760 --> 01:07:04.850
<b>I don't know.</b>

01:07:06.430 --> 01:07:09.560
<b>Hey, blast me towards the guy.</b>

01:07:09.650 --> 01:07:11.480
<b>What? What are you thinking?</b>

01:07:12.690 --> 01:07:13.980
<b>Please, just do it!</b>

01:07:16.820 --> 01:07:19.990
<b>Sky High!</b>

01:07:33.170 --> 01:07:36.300
<b><i>Rock Bison, who's had</i>
<i>no opportunity to shine all season,</i></b>

01:07:36.380 --> 01:07:37.840
<b><i>has finally done it!</i></b>

01:07:53.400 --> 01:07:56.280
<b>That won't work, young lady.</b>

01:08:03.490 --> 01:08:06.620
<b><i>Oh no! The suspect</i>
<i>is closing in on Dragon Kid!</i></b>

01:08:08.870 --> 01:08:12.710
<b>I'll start by putting you to sleep first.</b>

01:08:27.430 --> 01:08:28.720
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

01:08:30.270 --> 01:08:32.520
<b><i>Unbelievable! It's Fire Emblem!</i></b>

01:08:34.610 --> 01:08:37.530
<b>Thank goodness! You woke up.</b>

01:08:37.610 --> 01:08:39.400
<b>You had us worried.</b>

01:08:39.490 --> 01:08:41.360
<b>We'll do the emotional reunion later.</b>

01:08:41.950 --> 01:08:44.450
<b>Let's put away that old fart first.</b>

01:08:46.700 --> 01:08:47.790
<b>Look out!</b>

01:08:47.870 --> 01:08:49.500
<b>I dare you.</b>

01:08:50.750 --> 01:08:54.040
<b>I no longer have
a single scar in my heart!</b>

01:08:55.880 --> 01:08:58.380
<b>Fire!</b>

01:09:05.050 --> 01:09:08.720
<b>They say a man is made of courage
and a woman is made of love.</b>

01:09:09.310 --> 01:09:11.640
<b>So what does that mean
for people that are gay?</b>

01:09:13.350 --> 01:09:14.980
<b>We are invincible!</b>

01:09:20.070 --> 01:09:21.440
<b>Way to go, Fire!</b>

01:09:30.330 --> 01:09:32.580
<b><i>Looks like it was still too soon</i>
<i>for him to join the fight.</i></b>

01:09:54.020 --> 01:09:57.020
<b>Enough!</b>

01:10:08.030 --> 01:10:09.780
<b>Huh? Did I just…</b>

01:10:20.880 --> 01:10:22.210
<b>Curse you!</b>

01:10:23.550 --> 01:10:25.970
<b>I'm not letting you get away!</b>

01:10:40.270 --> 01:10:41.860
<b><i>They've done it!</i></b>

01:10:41.940 --> 01:10:44.320
<b><i>Fire Emblem has returned,</i>
<i>and combining their powers,</i></b>

01:10:44.400 --> 01:10:47.280
<b><i>the three heroes have</i>
<i>brought down the suspect!</i></b>

01:11:11.850 --> 01:11:13.310
<b>That was close.</b>

01:11:21.150 --> 01:11:21.980
<b>Bunny?!</b>

01:11:25.570 --> 01:11:26.940
<b>That hurts!</b>

01:11:27.440 --> 01:11:28.900
<b>What are you doing?</b>

01:11:28.990 --> 01:11:31.990
<b>Let me guess. You mistimed activating
your power again, didn't you?</b>

01:11:32.070 --> 01:11:34.740
<b>I haven't used it yet.
Especially after what you told me.</b>

01:11:35.830 --> 01:11:38.370
<b>My hands are all numb!</b>

01:11:45.000 --> 01:11:47.840
<b>Hey, forget about that guy.</b>

01:11:47.920 --> 01:11:49.380
<b>Our prey is getting away!</b>

01:11:50.880 --> 01:11:51.840
<b>Right.</b>

01:11:53.970 --> 01:11:55.310
<b>-Huh?
-Huh?</b>

01:11:55.890 --> 01:11:57.770
<b><i>I can see them. I see them now!</i></b>

01:11:58.600 --> 01:11:59.600
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

01:12:02.560 --> 01:12:04.230
<b>What's he doing there?</b>

01:12:04.320 --> 01:12:05.520
<b><i>That's…</i></b>

01:12:07.030 --> 01:12:08.320
<b><i>Lunatic!</i></b>

01:12:08.400 --> 01:12:10.820
<b><i>Just as our cameras caught sight</i>
<i>of Barnaby and the others,</i></b>

01:12:10.900 --> 01:12:13.320
<b><i>there is Lunatic!</i></b>

01:12:13.910 --> 01:12:15.120
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

01:12:15.200 --> 01:12:18.750
<b><i>Lunatic only goes after murderers.</i>
<i>So what brings him here?</i></b>

01:12:19.250 --> 01:12:21.540
<b>Dude gives me the creeps.</b>

01:12:21.620 --> 01:12:24.130
<b>-You two go after that mechanical monster.
-What?</b>

01:12:25.960 --> 01:12:27.340
<b>Kotetsu!</b>

01:12:30.510 --> 01:12:33.260
<b>I'll look after this guy.</b>

01:12:34.010 --> 01:12:35.600
<b>Hey! Let's go.</b>

01:12:36.970 --> 01:12:38.100
<b>Hey!</b>

01:12:39.480 --> 01:12:40.600
<b>Suit yourself!</b>

01:12:53.030 --> 01:12:54.660
<b>Get going!</b>

01:12:54.740 --> 01:12:56.780
<b>What good is a team
if you're not working together?</b>

01:12:56.870 --> 01:12:58.330
<b>-But…
-Bunny!</b>

01:13:04.920 --> 01:13:06.960
<b>Be gone. I have no business with you.</b>

01:13:07.040 --> 01:13:10.460
<b>Our boss is in the hands of that machine.</b>

01:13:10.550 --> 01:13:13.300
<b>We can't have you butting in.</b>

01:13:13.380 --> 01:13:14.930
<b>Fool.</b>

01:13:15.010 --> 01:13:17.680
<b>-You can't even see what the true evil is.
-Huh?</b>

01:13:18.260 --> 01:13:22.180
<b>Thanatos always speaks the truth.</b>

01:13:22.270 --> 01:13:26.190
<b><i>Can Wild Tiger stop Lunatic on his own?</i></b>

01:13:26.270 --> 01:13:27.230
<b>Dad…</b>

01:13:28.360 --> 01:13:29.610
<b>What's that up there?</b>

01:13:35.700 --> 01:13:37.830
<b>What are you going to do to me?!</b>

01:13:54.760 --> 01:13:57.680
<b><i>Hear me, citizens of Stern Bild!</i></b>

01:13:58.550 --> 01:14:01.430
<b><i>Tonight, I shall reenact the justice</i></b>

01:14:01.520 --> 01:14:04.270
<b><i>that the legendary Goddess demonstrated.</i></b>

01:14:04.770 --> 01:14:09.110
<b><i>Let the death of this man</i>
<i>be burned into your memories!</i></b>

01:14:28.040 --> 01:14:29.130
<b>Ryan!</b>

01:14:32.500 --> 01:14:35.090
<b>Don't tell me what to do!</b>

01:14:43.560 --> 01:14:46.810
<b>Looks like we got him.</b>

01:14:46.890 --> 01:14:48.100
<b><i>They've done it!</i></b>

01:14:48.190 --> 01:14:52.230
<b><i>Ryan and Barnaby take down an enemy</i>
<i>for the second time today!</i></b>

01:14:52.820 --> 01:14:56.070
<b>What is this machine anyway?</b>

01:14:56.650 --> 01:14:59.160
<b>Is this supposed to be the Goddess?</b>

01:15:02.080 --> 01:15:03.410
<b>Keep your hands off of that!</b>

01:15:04.580 --> 01:15:05.910
<b>What is the meaning of this?</b>

01:15:06.000 --> 01:15:09.210
<b>So you're the one
who was pulling all the strings…</b>

01:15:09.290 --> 01:15:10.920
<b>Eh, Mr. Virgil?</b>

01:15:11.420 --> 01:15:13.050
<b>Hey, are you all right?</b>

01:15:14.920 --> 01:15:16.420
<b>Yeah…</b>

01:15:17.420 --> 01:15:19.090
<b>What just happened?</b>

01:15:21.050 --> 01:15:22.600
<b>That bastard…</b>

01:15:23.100 --> 01:15:24.350
<b>It's Andrew.</b>

01:15:24.430 --> 01:15:25.640
<b>What?</b>

01:15:25.720 --> 01:15:29.060
<b>Andrew Scott. That's my name.</b>

01:15:29.770 --> 01:15:30.690
<b>"Scott"?</b>

01:15:32.440 --> 01:15:34.860
<b>Does Scott System ring a bell?</b>

01:15:34.940 --> 01:15:35.820
<b>Huh?</b>

01:15:35.900 --> 01:15:37.650
<b>Of course it doesn't.</b>

01:15:38.200 --> 01:15:41.910
<b>My father's company was very small.</b>

01:15:44.790 --> 01:15:46.450
<b><i>He was a good father.</i></b>

01:15:47.200 --> 01:15:49.330
<b><i>He raised me as a single parent.</i></b>

01:15:49.410 --> 01:15:52.960
<b><i>No matter how busy he was,</i>
<i>he never spoke a word of complaint.</i></b>

01:15:53.590 --> 01:15:55.800
<b><i>My father was a hard worker</i></b>

01:15:55.880 --> 01:15:58.380
<b><i>and somehow managed</i>
<i>to keep the company going.</i></b>

01:15:58.470 --> 01:16:00.800
<b><i>Even a young child like me</i>
<i>could understand that.</i></b>

01:16:00.880 --> 01:16:02.800
<b><i>That's why when a man showed up</i></b>

01:16:02.890 --> 01:16:05.560
<b><i>saying he'd help my father's business,</i></b>

01:16:05.640 --> 01:16:07.180
<b><i>I nearly jumped for joy.</i></b>

01:16:07.680 --> 01:16:09.480
<b><i>That man was Schneider.</i></b>

01:16:10.600 --> 01:16:12.600
<b><i>The company grew almost instantly.</i></b>

01:16:12.690 --> 01:16:14.060
<b><i>Schneider was our savior.</i></b>

01:16:14.860 --> 01:16:19.070
<b>I felt I would be indebted to him
all my life…</b>

01:16:19.150 --> 01:16:21.320
<b>until my father committed suicide.</b>

01:16:23.910 --> 01:16:25.200
<b><i>I swear to you,</i></b>

01:16:25.280 --> 01:16:28.500
<b><i>my father was not a man</i>
<i>who would take his own life!</i></b>

01:16:28.580 --> 01:16:30.250
<b><i>Like a man possessed,</i></b>

01:16:30.330 --> 01:16:33.000
<b><i>I searched for the truth</i>
<i>behind my father's death.</i></b>

01:16:33.500 --> 01:16:36.460
<b><i>And then I learned the truth!</i></b>

01:16:37.050 --> 01:16:39.010
<b><i>I found out that my father</i></b>

01:16:39.090 --> 01:16:42.130
<b><i>was forced to sell his company</i>
<i>after being tricked.</i></b>

01:16:42.220 --> 01:16:43.970
<b><i>Schneider used my father</i></b>

01:16:44.050 --> 01:16:45.890
<b>to hide his illegal investments!</b>

01:16:47.510 --> 01:16:50.810
<b>I planned to expose everything
and bring the hammer down on him.</b>

01:16:50.890 --> 01:16:53.440
<b>For that singular purpose,
I infiltrated his company,</b>

01:16:53.520 --> 01:16:56.520
<b>and spent years digging up
the whole truth as his secretary.</b>

01:16:56.610 --> 01:16:58.190
<b>And then that moment arrived.</b>

01:17:00.440 --> 01:17:03.950
<b><i>Security is undermanned</i>
<i>on the day of the festival.</i></b>

01:17:04.530 --> 01:17:07.280
<b>All that was left
was to keep you heroes occupied.</b>

01:17:07.370 --> 01:17:09.830
<b>That's why you used
the legend of the Goddess.</b>

01:17:09.910 --> 01:17:11.750
<b><i>That's not the only reason.</i></b>

01:17:11.830 --> 01:17:14.120
<b><i>I wanted to let the people see this demon</i></b>

01:17:14.210 --> 01:17:17.670
<b>who lost his righteous heart
getting punished.</b>

01:17:17.750 --> 01:17:21.050
<b>Is that why you hired those NEXTs?</b>

01:17:21.130 --> 01:17:22.420
<b>Hired?</b>

01:17:25.470 --> 01:17:28.640
<b>We are comrades
who swore revenge on Schneider.</b>

01:17:29.140 --> 01:17:30.770
<b>They are victims as well.</b>

01:17:34.900 --> 01:17:36.150
<b>Mr. Barnaby.</b>

01:17:36.940 --> 01:17:40.190
<b>You yourself became a hero
to exact revenge.</b>

01:17:41.570 --> 01:17:42.690
<b>I'm so close…</b>

01:17:43.280 --> 01:17:45.700
<b>So close to ending everything.</b>

01:17:46.660 --> 01:17:49.620
<b>Do you still intend to stop me?</b>

01:17:52.370 --> 01:17:55.420
<b>So you're saying you came to help them
with their revenge?</b>

01:17:55.500 --> 01:17:58.130
<b>Protecting evildoers is a grave crime.</b>

01:17:58.210 --> 01:18:00.590
<b>Justice must be done.</b>

01:18:00.670 --> 01:18:02.050
<b>We're talking revenge here…</b>

01:18:02.130 --> 01:18:03.970
<b>There's nothing good about killing.</b>

01:18:04.050 --> 01:18:09.850
<b>You reject killing,
but didn't your partner find peace</b>

01:18:09.930 --> 01:18:12.720
<b>when his parents' killer met his end?</b>

01:18:13.310 --> 01:18:16.480
<b>It's true that there was a time
when I sought revenge.</b>

01:18:17.230 --> 01:18:19.650
<b>I thought it would bring back
the future that I lost</b>

01:18:19.730 --> 01:18:22.230
<b>when my parents were taken away from me.</b>

01:18:22.320 --> 01:18:26.110
<b>Then why are you trying to save
that man's life?</b>

01:18:26.700 --> 01:18:28.030
<b>The person I want to save…</b>

01:18:29.200 --> 01:18:30.120
<b>is you!</b>

01:18:31.830 --> 01:18:34.830
<b>The guy is still dealing
with his pain to this day!</b>

01:18:34.910 --> 01:18:36.710
<b>He's trying desperately to move forward</b>

01:18:36.790 --> 01:18:39.080
<b>by accepting everything
that's happened in the past!</b>

01:18:39.170 --> 01:18:41.340
<b>To live on by accepting the present.</b>

01:18:42.250 --> 01:18:43.960
<b>He taught me that.</b>

01:18:44.670 --> 01:18:46.880
<b>He stopped me from taking the wrong path.</b>

01:18:46.970 --> 01:18:49.220
<b>It's because of him that I'm here today.</b>

01:18:49.720 --> 01:18:51.850
<b>I have no intention of stopping.</b>

01:18:51.930 --> 01:18:56.100
<b>In that case, I will stop you
no matter what it takes!</b>

01:18:58.900 --> 01:18:59.860
<b>That's too bad.</b>

01:19:06.610 --> 01:19:09.570
<b>It seems I've overrated you.</b>

01:19:09.660 --> 01:19:14.200
<b>I want nothing to do with a justice
that forces people to kill!</b>

01:19:14.290 --> 01:19:15.120
<b>Fine.</b>

01:19:15.910 --> 01:19:20.580
<b>Then I shall crush evil,
along with your spineless justice,</b>

01:19:20.670 --> 01:19:23.040
<b>right here and now!</b>

01:19:37.430 --> 01:19:41.560
<b>That's a cool ability.
But it's no match for me!</b>

01:19:41.650 --> 01:19:43.020
<b>Here it comes!</b>

01:19:50.450 --> 01:19:51.320
<b>Barnaby!</b>

01:19:54.410 --> 01:19:56.830
<b><i>Ryan attacks while Barnaby protects!</i></b>

01:19:56.910 --> 01:19:59.120
<b><i>Their teamwork shines once again!</i></b>

01:20:15.180 --> 01:20:18.730
<b>That dude's stealing my spotlight!</b>

01:20:18.810 --> 01:20:19.810
<b>Huh?</b>

01:20:19.890 --> 01:20:21.900
<b>Hey… Just a minute!</b>

01:20:23.230 --> 01:20:25.480
<b>Hey, what's going on? It just went off!</b>

01:20:25.570 --> 01:20:26.690
<b>What happened?</b>

01:20:26.780 --> 01:20:28.780
<b>We lost the chopper carrying the camera.</b>

01:20:28.860 --> 01:20:29.740
<b>What?!</b>

01:20:33.700 --> 01:20:34.740
<b>Ryan!</b>

01:20:38.830 --> 01:20:42.920
<b>Out of my way, Barnaby!</b>

01:20:52.340 --> 01:20:55.350
<b>An eviscerated justice saves no one.</b>

01:20:55.430 --> 01:20:57.350
<b>Destroying evil is the only way</b>

01:20:57.430 --> 01:20:59.430
<b>to free ourselves
of the curse of our past.</b>

01:20:59.520 --> 01:21:02.850
<b>You don't know the first thing
about what he's been through!</b>

01:21:05.560 --> 01:21:07.690
<b>-Haven't you restored the feed yet?
-In a moment.</b>

01:21:10.650 --> 01:21:11.490
<b><i>What's this?!</i></b>

01:21:15.910 --> 01:21:18.830
<b>You already know the truth, don't you?</b>

01:21:23.420 --> 01:21:26.630
<b>That what you're doing
won't solve anything!</b>

01:21:26.710 --> 01:21:27.590
<b>Shut up!</b>

01:21:28.380 --> 01:21:32.090
<b>Even if you succeed with your revenge,
it won't bring your father back.</b>

01:21:32.170 --> 01:21:33.590
<b>That's the reality!</b>

01:22:10.920 --> 01:22:14.720
<b>The justice you uphold
is a superficial one.</b>

01:22:14.800 --> 01:22:17.300
<b>All it does is allow you
to overlook true evil.</b>

01:22:17.390 --> 01:22:20.720
<b>No one needs a hero like that!</b>

01:22:20.810 --> 01:22:24.560
<b>I'm not a hero
because I want to feel needed!</b>

01:22:24.640 --> 01:22:28.150
<b>What can a hero like you,
who refuses to bring evil to justice,</b>

01:22:28.230 --> 01:22:29.230
<b>possibly accomplish?!</b>

01:22:29.310 --> 01:22:34.110
<b>If someone needs help,
I'm there for them.</b>

01:22:34.190 --> 01:22:35.400
<b>It's as simple as that!</b>

01:22:48.830 --> 01:22:50.290
<b>Give it up.</b>

01:22:58.550 --> 01:23:00.050
<b><i>Forgive me.</i></b>

01:23:00.550 --> 01:23:03.470
<b><i>The situation has left me speechless.</i></b>

01:23:09.650 --> 01:23:11.400
<b>Oh no you don't…</b>

01:23:11.480 --> 01:23:14.530
<b>I'm not letting you go there!</b>

01:23:15.110 --> 01:23:16.530
<b><i>Ever!</i></b>

01:23:21.870 --> 01:23:24.620
<b>Let's put an end to this, Mr. Barnaby.</b>

01:23:32.500 --> 01:23:33.590
<b>If that's how you want it…</b>

01:23:35.550 --> 01:23:40.340
<b>I'll watch you
as you resign yourself to defeat.</b>

01:23:40.840 --> 01:23:43.510
<b>Wait! Please!</b>

01:23:43.600 --> 01:23:46.730
<b>Barnaby!</b>

01:23:46.810 --> 01:23:49.600
<b>With this, everything will return
to nothingness.</b>

01:23:58.820 --> 01:24:00.030
<b>Ow!</b>

01:24:00.110 --> 01:24:01.280
<b>Kotetsu?</b>

01:24:01.360 --> 01:24:02.320
<b>Bunny!</b>

01:24:02.410 --> 01:24:03.370
<b>Wait, that means…</b>

01:24:05.160 --> 01:24:06.410
<b>You're in my way!</b>

01:24:19.300 --> 01:24:21.050
<b>What the hell are you doing?</b>

01:24:21.130 --> 01:24:23.050
<b>Did you come here intending to save him?</b>

01:24:23.140 --> 01:24:25.260
<b>Huh? Well, sort of…</b>

01:24:25.350 --> 01:24:26.770
<b>You can't do it on your own.</b>

01:24:26.850 --> 01:24:28.310
<b>Then give me a hand!</b>

01:24:31.940 --> 01:24:34.770
<b>Don't worry, I was planning to.</b>

01:24:35.440 --> 01:24:36.690
<b><i>What's this?</i></b>

01:24:36.780 --> 01:24:39.690
<b><i>It looks like Wild Tiger and Barnaby are…</i></b>

01:25:09.430 --> 01:25:11.180
<b>His legs are all over the place.</b>

01:25:11.270 --> 01:25:13.310
<b>The only way is to keep attacking.</b>

01:25:24.700 --> 01:25:25.740
<b>Kotetsu!</b>

01:25:47.050 --> 01:25:48.010
<b>Kotetsu!</b>

01:25:51.890 --> 01:25:53.480
<b>Bunny! How're your powers?</b>

01:25:53.560 --> 01:25:55.400
<b>They're still recharging!</b>

01:25:56.230 --> 01:25:57.690
<b>Then I have no choice…</b>

01:25:59.770 --> 01:26:00.690
<b>Goodbye.</b>

01:26:13.870 --> 01:26:15.080
<b>Impossible!</b>

01:26:31.850 --> 01:26:33.890
<b>Don't interfere!</b>

01:26:33.980 --> 01:26:36.390
<b>Fire!</b>

01:26:52.990 --> 01:26:54.830
<b>Time to stay down!</b>

01:26:56.920 --> 01:27:00.460
<b><i>Yes! The heroes have finally assembled!</i></b>

01:27:00.540 --> 01:27:02.590
<b>Damn you all!</b>

01:27:04.130 --> 01:27:05.510
<b>Not yet, Bunny?</b>

01:27:06.420 --> 01:27:07.630
<b>Handsome!</b>

01:27:07.720 --> 01:27:08.760
<b>Mr. Barnaby!</b>

01:27:08.840 --> 01:27:10.010
<b>Quickly!</b>

01:27:10.090 --> 01:27:11.100
<b>Mister Wild!</b>

01:27:11.180 --> 01:27:12.180
<b>Tiger!</b>

01:27:12.260 --> 01:27:14.020
<b>-Hey!
<i>-</i>Not yet?!</b>

01:27:28.610 --> 01:27:31.320
<b>Kiss my boots!</b>

01:27:31.410 --> 01:27:34.200
<b><i>The Gravity Prince is back in the game!</i></b>

01:27:36.290 --> 01:27:38.330
<b>-Kotetsu!
-All right!</b>

01:27:38.920 --> 01:27:40.120
<b>-Let's do this!
-Right!</b>

01:27:51.720 --> 01:27:53.390
<b>He's all yours!</b>

01:28:31.760 --> 01:28:33.930
<b><i>Powers exhausted in ten seconds.</i></b>

01:28:34.010 --> 01:28:36.060
<b>-Bunny!
-I know!</b>

01:28:51.990 --> 01:28:54.240
<b><i>Tiger &amp; Bunny. Over and Out!</i></b>

01:29:39.990 --> 01:29:40.870
<b>Not gonna happen!</b>

01:29:55.470 --> 01:29:57.640
<b>We sure made a huge mess again.</b>

01:29:57.720 --> 01:30:00.520
<b>This time, I thought I was a goner.</b>

01:30:01.100 --> 01:30:03.600
<b>Is that what you think about
when you fight?</b>

01:30:03.680 --> 01:30:07.150
<b>-What?
-You're so negative, Origami.</b>

01:30:07.230 --> 01:30:11.530
<b>So what? It's part
of what makes him who he is.</b>

01:30:11.610 --> 01:30:14.740
<b>A part of who we are…</b>

01:30:15.320 --> 01:30:18.370
<b>So it's okay to be myself?
Yes, it's okay!</b>

01:30:18.450 --> 01:30:20.030
<b>Huh? What are you talking about?</b>

01:30:20.120 --> 01:30:21.540
<b>Oh, nothing.</b>

01:30:21.620 --> 01:30:23.450
<b>You are so weird.</b>

01:30:25.120 --> 01:30:28.840
<b>What you people did today
was mind-blowing!</b>

01:30:28.920 --> 01:30:31.000
<b>You truly are heroes.</b>

01:30:31.090 --> 01:30:33.210
<b>Especially the fine teamwork
of Tiger &amp; Barnaby</b>

01:30:33.300 --> 01:30:35.300
<b>just like the good old days!</b>

01:30:35.380 --> 01:30:38.300
<b>I wouldn't say team, right?</b>

01:30:38.390 --> 01:30:41.010
<b>-Right…
-Don't be so modest!</b>

01:30:41.100 --> 01:30:42.810
<b>You worked in perfect tandem!</b>

01:30:42.890 --> 01:30:43.810
<b>Hey, I know!</b>

01:30:43.890 --> 01:30:46.560
<b>Why don't you guys form a trio?</b>

01:30:46.640 --> 01:30:49.940
<b>-What?
-"Ryan and Barnaby with Tiger"!</b>

01:30:50.020 --> 01:30:51.320
<b>Or maybe "featuring"?</b>

01:30:51.400 --> 01:30:52.360
<b>But…</b>

01:30:52.860 --> 01:30:55.650
<b>No, you should come back as a duo.</b>

01:30:56.240 --> 01:30:57.280
<b>What?</b>

01:30:57.360 --> 01:30:58.240
<b>Hey. Camera!</b>

01:30:59.740 --> 01:31:01.740
<b>That's right!</b>

01:31:01.830 --> 01:31:04.620
<b>I knew it from the start!</b>

01:31:04.700 --> 01:31:07.460
<b>-These guys are made for each other!
-Huh?</b>

01:31:07.540 --> 01:31:10.710
<b>That's why I arranged
for a feel-good comeback.</b>

01:31:10.790 --> 01:31:11.750
<b>Camera!</b>

01:31:12.300 --> 01:31:15.590
<b>I made you guys look good!</b>

01:31:15.670 --> 01:31:16.920
<b>Be sure to thank me.</b>

01:31:17.010 --> 01:31:18.840
<b>-Huh?!
-Listen, guys!</b>

01:31:18.930 --> 01:31:22.100
<b>Take some advice from the great Ryan.</b>

01:31:22.180 --> 01:31:24.680
<b>You're the only partners for one another!</b>

01:31:27.980 --> 01:31:30.400
<b>What'll it be, guys?</b>

01:31:30.480 --> 01:31:33.440
<b>We can't decide that by ourselves.</b>

01:31:33.520 --> 01:31:35.070
<b><i>I approve it!</i></b>

01:31:36.320 --> 01:31:38.400
<b><i>Bonjour, everyone.</i></b>

01:31:38.490 --> 01:31:43.330
<b><i>Earlier, I, Agnes Joubert,</i>
<i>was granted sole and full authority</i></b>

01:31:43.410 --> 01:31:44.870
<b>by Mr. Schneider.</b>

01:31:46.700 --> 01:31:49.870
<b>Anyway, with our owner
in his current condition…</b>

01:31:49.960 --> 01:31:53.210
<b>As his agent, I approve
the reinstatement of these two!</b>

01:31:54.960 --> 01:31:56.670
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

01:31:56.760 --> 01:31:58.800
<b>Not ready yet to make the big decision?</b>

01:31:58.880 --> 01:32:00.720
<b>No, I mean…</b>

01:32:01.930 --> 01:32:06.640
<b>I'm a changed man, and besides,
my power only lasts for a minute.</b>

01:32:06.720 --> 01:32:07.890
<b>Tiger…</b>

01:32:12.940 --> 01:32:14.900
<b><i>That doesn't matter!</i></b>

01:32:19.200 --> 01:32:23.990
<b><i>You helped me</i>
<i>when I needed you, Wild Tiger!</i></b>

01:32:24.080 --> 01:32:27.370
<b><i>You're a hero, Wild Tiger.</i></b>

01:32:28.290 --> 01:32:29.580
<b><i>That's right!</i></b>

01:32:29.660 --> 01:32:32.380
<b><i>Just watching you cheers me up!</i></b>

01:32:32.460 --> 01:32:34.210
<b><i>So what if it's just one minute?</i></b>

01:32:34.290 --> 01:32:36.590
<b><i>We want to see you</i>
<i>giving everything you've got.</i></b>

01:32:36.670 --> 01:32:38.670
<b>-That's right!
-Yeah!</b>

01:32:38.760 --> 01:32:40.930
<b>-Yes, that's right!
-Of course!</b>

01:32:41.010 --> 01:32:43.430
<b><i>You're our hero, Mr. Tiger!</i></b>

01:32:43.510 --> 01:32:49.430
<b>-Tiger!
-Tiger!</b>

01:32:52.020 --> 01:32:54.560
<b>Mr. Tiger really is amazing.</b>

01:32:55.060 --> 01:32:57.230
<b>He moved the hearts
of all these people.</b>

01:32:58.030 --> 01:33:00.950
<b>You see! Everyone's behind you!</b>

01:33:05.370 --> 01:33:06.700
<b>Are you okay with this?</b>

01:33:13.420 --> 01:33:15.130
<b>We can't say no to this crowd…</b>

01:33:16.000 --> 01:33:16.920
<b>It's okay with me.</b>

01:33:17.630 --> 01:33:19.800
<b>With you around, it'll make me stand out.</b>

01:33:33.890 --> 01:33:39.070
<b>As of this moment,
Tiger &amp; Barnaby are back!</b>

01:33:50.330 --> 01:33:51.830
<b>Kaburagi, you're next.</b>

01:33:52.410 --> 01:33:53.250
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

01:33:54.040 --> 01:33:56.710
<b>"The Sun" by Kaede Kaburagi.</b>

01:33:57.710 --> 01:33:58.710
<b><i>"Did you know?"</i></b>

01:33:59.300 --> 01:34:02.090
<b><i>"There are other suns besides the one</i>
<i>that shines brightly in the sky."</i></b>

01:34:02.670 --> 01:34:04.470
<b><i>"The tiger that runs proudly,</i></b>

01:34:04.550 --> 01:34:06.840
<b><i>the bunny that hops about,</i></b>

01:34:06.930 --> 01:34:09.220
<b><i>the ice that glistens brilliantly,</i></b>

01:34:09.810 --> 01:34:11.720
<b><i>the wind that blows briskly,</i></b>

01:34:12.310 --> 01:34:14.230
<b><i>the fire that burns intensely,</i></b>

01:34:14.310 --> 01:34:16.480
<b><i>the cow that moos loudly,</i></b>

01:34:16.560 --> 01:34:18.730
<b><i>the shadow that changes suddenly,</i></b>

01:34:19.320 --> 01:34:21.440
<b><i>the lightning that flashes brightly."</i></b>

01:34:22.110 --> 01:34:23.900
<b><i>"They're all different,</i></b>

01:34:24.450 --> 01:34:26.700
<b><i>but they all have a sun</i>
<i>burning inside of them."</i></b>

01:34:26.780 --> 01:34:32.200
<b><i>"Sometimes they feel sad</i>
<i>and hurt and down,</i></b>

01:34:32.290 --> 01:34:33.830
<b><i>but eventually, the sun will rise."</i></b>

01:34:33.910 --> 01:34:35.870
<b><i>"Everyone's sun will rise."</i></b>

01:34:35.960 --> 01:34:38.500
<b><i>"The sun always rises when you're down."</i></b>

01:34:38.580 --> 01:34:41.130
<b><i>"The sun rises no matter what."</i></b>

01:34:41.710 --> 01:34:44.590
<b><i>"Today and tomorrow,</i>
<i>the sun is always rising."</i></b>

01:38:02.370 --> 01:38:05.750
<b>A billionaire from overseas
made me an offer.</b>

01:38:06.250 --> 01:38:07.290
<b>See?</b>

01:38:09.250 --> 01:38:12.760
<b>I can't stay
in this small-time place anymore.</b>

01:38:12.840 --> 01:38:14.340
<b>So I'll see you around!</b>

01:38:17.050 --> 01:38:20.810
<b>Sorry we're such
a "small-time" company. Right?</b>

01:40:05.870 --> 01:40:08.120
<b>Hey, can I take a turn
driving for a change?</b>

01:40:08.210 --> 01:40:09.080
<b>No.</b>
